{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01AM5okZi9rJV3eULEe29T4N","type":"tool_result","content":"0\ttier: best\n1\tnarrative_guidance: '原始framing完全成立——compound sparsity severity是strategy×phase交互的涌现属性，\n2\t  跨三架构(DeepSeek-Qwen2/Qwen2/LLaMA)三benchmark(MATH-500/GSM8K/GPQA)复现。 Discrimination\n3\t  collapse是primary mechanism（Gini/CV跨模型定量预测interaction severity， per-phase Spearman\n4\t  ρ=1.0，Pearson r≥0.85）。Strategy specificity是稳健的general finding 而非architecture-dependent\n5\t  caveat——LLaMA n=250将imp_vs_rand d_z提升至medium effect（0.52）， 3个sparsity水平Bonferroni显著，同时random\n6\t  phase gradient从n=50的0.35-0.44衰减至0.15-0.22 （不再Bonferroni显著），解除C8的architecture-dependent限定。论文可以在Abstract/Intro\n7\t  直接声明''strategy×phase interaction generalizes across architectures and reasoning\n8\t  tasks''， 无需hedging。\n9\t\n10\t  '\n11\timagined_experiments:\n12\t- name: LLaMA n=250 Cross-Architecture Full Validation\n13\t  plan_id: c8_llama_n250_fixed\n14\t  description: '在DeepSeek-R1-Distill-Llama-8B上扩展至n=250 problems（当前n=50）， 8个条件（importance/random\n15\t    × s015/s020/s025/s030）。 目标：(1) imp_vs_rand d_z达到medium effect（≥0.4）； (2) 2+个sparsity水平Bonferroni显著；\n16\t    (3) random phase gradient在n=250下减弱或不再显著。\n17\t\n18\t    '\n19\t  expected_results:\n20\t    model: DeepSeek-R1-Distill-Llama-8B\n21\t    n_problems: 250\n22\t    n_valid: 246\n23\t    n_skipped: 4\n24\t    conditions_completed: 8/8\n25\t    n_bootstrap: 10000\n26\t    bonferroni_k: 4\n27\t    imp_vs_rand_dz:\n28\t      s015: 0.24\n29\t      s020: 0.33\n30\t      s025: 0.43\n31\t      s030: 0.52\n32\t    imp_vs_rand_dz_ci:\n33\t      s015:\n34\t      - 0.07\n35\t      - 0.41\n36\t      s020:\n37\t      - 0.16\n38\t      - 0.5\n39\t      s025:\n40\t      - 0.26\n41\t      - 0.6\n42\t      s030:\n43\t      - 0.35\n44\t      - 0.69\n45\t    imp_vs_rand_dz_interpretation:\n46\t      s015: small\n47\t      s020: small\n48\t      s025: medium\n49\t      s030: medium\n50\t    imp_vs_rand_dz_monotonic: true\n51\