22 （不再Bonferroni显著），解除C8的architecture-dependent限定。论文可以在Abstract/Intro\n  直接声明''strategy×phase interaction generalizes across architectures and reasoning\n  tasks''， 无需hedging。\n\n  '\nimagined_experiments:\n- name: LLaMA n=250 Cross-Architecture Full Validation\n  plan_id: c8_llama_n250_fixed\n  description: '在DeepSeek-R1-Distill-Llama-8B上扩展至n=250 problems（当前n=50）， 8个条件（importance/random\n    × s015/s020/s025/s030）。 目标：(1) imp_vs_rand d_z达到medium effect（≥0.4）； (2) 2+个sparsity水平Bonferroni显著；\n    (3) random phase gradient在n=250下减弱或不再显著。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    model: DeepSeek-R1-Distill-Llama-8B\n    n_problems: 250\n    n_valid: 246\n    n_skipped: 4\n    conditions_completed: 8/8\n    n_bootstrap: 10000\n    bonferroni_k: 4\n    imp_vs_rand_dz:\n      s015: 0.24\n      s020: 0.33\n      s025: 0.43\n      s030: 0.52\n    imp_vs_rand_dz_ci:\n      s015:\n      - 0.07\n      - 0.41\n      s020:\n      - 0.16\n      - 0.5\n      s025:\n      - 0.26\n      - 0.6\n      s030:\n      - 0.35\n      - 0.69\n    imp_vs_rand_dz_interpretation:\n      s015: small\n      s020: small\n      s025: medium\n      s030: medium\n    imp_vs_rand_dz_monotonic: true\n    phase_gradient_importance_dz:\n      s015: 0.92\n      s020: 1.01\n      s025: 1.05\n      s030: 0.97\n    phase_gradient_importance_dz_ci:\n      s015:\n      - 0.72\n      - 1.12\n      s020:\n      - 0.83\n      - 1.19\n      s025:\n      - 0.88\n      - 1.22\n      s030:\n      - 0.81\n      - 1.13\n    phase_gradient_importance_interpretation: all_large\n    phase_gradient_random_dz:\n      s015: 0.15\n      s020: 0.18\n      s025: 0.21\n      s030: 0.22\n    phase_gradient_random_dz_ci:\n      s015:\n      - -0.02\n      - 0.32\n      s020:\n      - 0.01\n      - 0.35\n      s025:\n      - 0.04\n      - 0.38\n      s030:\n      - 0.05\n      - 0.39\n    phase_gradient_random_interpretation: negligible_to_small\n    median_diff:\n      s015: 0.025\n      s020: 0.052\n      s025: 0.148\n      s030: 0.415\