{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01DM4bthdRes6XsT8nWbZZf9","type":"tool_result","content":"100\t      - 0.012\n101\t      - 0.108\n102\t      s025:\n103\t      - 0.055\n104\t      - 0.28\n105\t      s030:\n106\t      - 0.18\n107\t      - 0.62\n108\t    wilcoxon_p:\n109\t      s015: 0.018\n110\t      s020: 0.004\n111\t      s025: 0.00035\n112\t      s030: 1.8e-05\n113\t    wilcoxon_p_bonferroni:\n114\t      s015: 0.072\n115\t      s020: 0.016\n116\t      s025: 0.0014\n117\t      s030: 7.2e-05\n118\t    significant_bonferroni:\n119\t      s015: false\n120\t      s020: true\n121\t      s025: true\n122\t      s030: true\n123\t    bonferroni_significant_count: 3\n124\t    cross_arch_comparison:\n125\t      deepseek_qwen2_imp_vs_rand_dz_s030: 0.8\n126\t      llama_imp_vs_rand_dz_s030: 0.52\n127\t      delta: 0.28\n128\t      note: 'LLaMA effect weaker than Qwen2 architecture but now unambiguously medium\n129\t        (d_z=0.52, CI excludes zero). Architecture modulates magnitude but not direction\n130\t        — strategy×phase interaction is a general phenomenon.\n131\t\n132\t        '\n133\t  result_rationale: 'n=50时imp_vs_rand d_z=0.19→0.34，CI极宽（s030 CI=[0.06,0.66]），统计功效不足。\n134\t    n=250使SE缩小√5≈2.24倍，效应量估计趋于真值。 关键推理：(1) n=50时random phase gradient d_z=0.35-0.44可能被采样变异性膨胀——\n135\t    random masking本质是无差别噪声注入，不应产生与importance同等的strategy-dependent phase调制。在n=250下，采样噪声被平滑，random\n136\t    d_z回落至~0.15-0.22，不再Bonferroni显著。 这与DS/QW在低sparsity下random NS的模式一致——n=50时LLaMA\n137\t    random显著是Type I error 因小样本变异性所致。(2) importance的phase gradient在LLaMA上始终强烈（d_z≈1.0，\n138\t    源于LLaMA架构的attention head数量28/层 vs Qwen2的28/层但GQA结构不同）， n=250确认这不是偶然。(3) imp_vs_rand\n139\t    d_z在n=250下稳定至0.24→0.52， s020/s025/s030三个水平Bonferroni显著，因为真效应在这些水平上为medium（d_z≈0.35-0.55），\n140\t    n=250给出>90%的功效。\n141\t\n142\t    '\n143\t  tables:\n144\t  - name: 'Table: LLaMA n=250 vs n=50 Effect Size Comparison'\n145\t    columns:\n146\t    - sparsity\n147\t    - n50_dz\n148\t    - n250_dz\n149\t    - n250_bonf_p\n150\t    - n250_significant\n151\t    rows:\n152\t    - - s015\n153\t      - 0.19\n154\t      - 0.24\n155\t      - 0.072\n156\t      - NS\n157\t    - - s020\n158\t      - 0.26\n159\t      - 0.33\n160\t      - 0.016\n161\t      - ✓\n162\t    - - s025\n163\t      - 0.29\n164\t      - 0.43\n165\t      - 0.0014\n166\t      - ✓\n167\t    - - s030\n168\t      - 0.34\n169\t      - 0.52\n170\t      - 7.2e-05\n171\t      - ✓\n172\t  - name: 'Table: Random Phase Gradient Attenuation (n=50 → n=250)'\n173\t    columns:\n174\t    - sparsity\n175\t    - n50_random_dz\n176\t    - n250_random_dz\n177\t    - n250_random_CI_contains_zero\n178\t    rows:\n179\t    - - s015\n180\t      - 0.35\n181\t      - 0.15\n182\t      - 'yes'\n183\t    - - s020\n184\t      - 0.37\n185\t      - 0.18\n186\t      - borderline\n187\t    - - s025\n188\t      - 0.45\n189\t      - 0.21\n190\t      - no (but not Bonf)\n191\t    - - s030\n192\t      - 0.44\n193\t      - 0.22\n194\t      - no (but not Bonf)\n195\t  figures_description:\n196\t  - 'fig_c8_n250_dz_comparison.pdf: 左panel=imp_vs_rand d_z随sparsity变化（n=50虚线 vs n=250实线，含CI\n197\t    band），右panel=random phase gradient d_z的n=50→n=250衰减，灰色区域标注Bonferroni显著阈值'\n198\t  - 'fig_c8_cross_arch_forest.pdf: Forest plot展示三架构(DS/QW/LLaMA)在4个sparsity水平的imp_vs_rand\n199\t    d_z及95% CI'\n200\t  analysis: 'LLaMA n=250结果解除了C8的architecture-dependent限定。三个关键变化： (1) imp_vs_rand d_z从n=50的仅s030\n201\t    Bonferroni显著(p=0.029)提升至3个水平显著 (s020 p=0.016, s025 p=0.001, s030 p<0.001)； (2)\n202\t    s030 d_z=0.52（medium effect），在best范围[0.4,0.65]内； (3) random phase gradient从d_z=0.35-0.44衰减至0.15-0.22，无一Bonferroni显著——\n203\t    这与DS/QW模式一致，排除了\"LLaMA上random也strategy-dependent\"的alternative explanation。 论文可删除\"suggests\"/\"provides\n204\t    partial support\"措辞，改为 \"Cross-architecture validation on LLaMA (n=250) confirms\n205\t    strategy×phase interaction with medium effect size (d_z=0.52 at s=0.30, Bonferroni\n206\t    p<0.001)\"。 Limitation仅保留magnitude差异（LLaMA d_z=0.52 vs Qwen2 d_z=0.80）。\n207\t\n208\t    '\n209\t- name: GPQA DeepSeek Importance Phase Gradient Profiling\n210\t  plan_id: gpqa_profiling_ds\n211\t  description: '在DeepSeek-R1-Distill-Qwen-7B上对GPQA-Diamond子集(n=50)运行importance masking\n212\t    across 4 sparsity levels (s015/s020/s025/s030)，验证phase gradient单调递增。\n213\t\n214\t    '\n215\t  expected_results:\n216\t    model: DeepSeek-R1-Distill-Qwen-7B\n217\t    benchmark: GPQA-Diamond\n218\t    n_problems: 50\n219\t    method: median + Wilcoxon + bootstrap_median(B=10000)\n220\t    importance:\n221\t      s015:\n222\t        median_gradient: 0.185\n223\t        ci_low: 0.062\n224\t        ci_high: 0.385\n225\t        wilcoxon_p: 0.0008\n226\t      s020:\n227\t        median_gradient: 0.582\n228\t        ci_low: 0.241\n229\t        ci_high: 0.935\n230\t        wilcoxon_p: 0.0002\n231\t      s025:\n232\t        median_gradient: 1.748\n233\t        ci_low: 0.82\n234\t        ci_high: 2.51\n235\t        wilcoxon_p: 0.0001\n236\t      s030:\n237\t        median_gradient: 4.105\n238\t        ci_low: 1.89\n239\t        ci_high: 8.82\n240\t        wilcoxon_p: 0.0001\n241\t    dose_response_monotonic: true\n242\t    spearman_rho: 1.0\n243\t    cross_benchmark_comparison:\n244\t      math500_ds_gradient_s030: 8.48\n245\t      gsm8k_ds_gradient_s030: 4.682\n246\t      gpqa_ds_gradient_s030: 4.105\n247\t      note: GPQA gradient magnitude between MATH-500 and GSM8K\n248\t  result_rationale: 'GPQA-Diamond是graduate-level科学推理任务，难度高于MATH-500。预测phase gradient\n249\t    单调递增的理由：(1) GPQA的reasoning chain通常较长（涉及多步科学推理）， 大量token落入low-sparsity phase——head\n250\t    pruning在这些phase中导致importance score 的discrimination collapse更严重，compound interaction因此更大；\n251\t    (2) DS在MATH-500上gradient为0.39→8.48，GSM8K上为0.241→4.682——GPQA预计 在两者之间（~0.19→4.10），因为GPQA虽然难度高但问题更短（多选题format），\n252\t    reasoning chain长度介于MATH和GSM之间； (3) 单调性在三个benchmark上一致，因为phase gradient的物理机制（discrimination\n253\t    collapse 在late phase最严重→compound interaction在low-sparsity phase最大）不依赖于task类型。\n254\t\n255\t    '\n256\t  tables:\n257\t  - name: 'Table: Cross-Benchmark Phase Gradient Comparison (DeepSeek)'\n258\t    columns:\n259\t    - sparsity\n260\t    - MATH-500\n261\t    - GSM8K\n262\t    - GPQA\n263\t    rows:\n264\t    - - s015\n265\t      - 0.39\n266\t      - 0.241\n267\t      - 0.185\n268\t    - - s020\n269\t      - 1.21\n270\t      - 0.74\n271\t      - 0.582\n272\t    - - s025\n273\t      - 3.99\n274\t      - 1.992\n275\t      - 1.748\n276\t    - - s030\n277\t      - 8.48\n278\t      - 4.682\n279\t      - 4.105\n280\t  figures_description:\n281\t  - 'fig_cross_benchmark_gradient.pdf: 三条线(MATH/GSM/GPQA)展示DS importance phase gradient随sparsity的dose-response曲线，标注均为单调递增'\n282\t  analysis: 'GPQA上DS importance phase gradient 0.185→4.105单调递增，Spearman ρ=1.0， 复现了MATH-500和GSM8K上的核心发现。Gradient\n283\t    magnitude介于MATH-500(8.48) 和GSM8K(4.682)之间，反映GPQA推理链长度的中间特性。 三benchmark全部单调递增（cross_benchmark_phase_gradient_monotonic_count=3），\n284\t    确认phase modulation是跨task的robust finding。\n285\t\n286\t    '\n287\t- name: GPQA Qwen Importance Phase Gradient Profiling\n288\t  plan_id: gpqa_profiling_qw\n289\t  description: '在Qwen2.5-7B-Instruct上对GPQA-Diamond(n=50)运行importance masking across\n290\t    4 sparsity levels，验证cross-model replication。\n291\t\n292\t    '\n293\t  expected_results:\n294\t    model: Qwen2.5-7B-Instruct\n295\t    benchmark: GPQA-Diamond\n296\t    n_problems: 50\n297\t    importance:\n298\t      s015:\n299\t        median_gradient: 0.042\n300\t        ci_low: 0.008\n301\t        ci_high: 0.095\n302\t        wilcoxon_p: 0.015\n303\t      s020:\n304\t        median_gradient: 0.195\n305\t        ci_low: 0.078\n306\t        ci_high: 0.358\n307\t        wilcoxon_p: 0.0005\n308\t      s025:\n309\t        median_gradient: 0.882\n310\t        ci_low: 0.45\n311\t        ci_high: 1.32\n312\t        wilcoxon_p: 0.0001\n313\t      s030:\n314\t        median_gradient: 2.35\n315\t        ci_low: 1.28\n316\t        ci_high: 3.68\n317\t        wilcoxon_p: 0.0001\n318\t    dose_response_monotonic: true\n319\t    spearman_rho: 1.0\n320\t    qw_ds_gradient_ratio_s030: 0.57\n321\t    note: QW magnitude ~57% of DS, consistent with MATH-500 pattern (QW ~37% of DS)\n322\t  result_rationale: 'QW在MATH-500上gradient为0.066→3.155（DS的~37%），在GSM8K上为0.039→2.092。\n323\t    GPQA预测QW gradient 0.042→2.350，DS比QW比值约1.75×，略低于MATH-500的2.7×但 高于GSM8K的2.2×。QW\n324\t    magnitude一贯小于DS（可能因Qwen2.5-7B-Instruct的 attention head utilization更均匀，pruning影响较分散），但方向和单调性完全一致。\n325\t    Onset threshold仍在s020+——s015 gradient仅0.042但CI不跨零（GPQA难度使得即使 低sparsity也有可检测的compound\n326\t    effect）。\n327\t\n328\t    '\n329\t  tables:\n330\t  - name: 'Table: Cross-Benchmark Phase Gradient Comparison (Qwen)'\n331\t    columns:\n332\t    - sparsity\n333\t    - MATH-500\n334\t    - GSM8K\n335\t    - GPQA\n336\t    rows:\n337\t    - - s015\n338\t      - 0.066\n339\t      - 0.039\n340\t      - 0.042\n341\t    - - s020\n342\t      - 0.307\n343\t      - 0.158\n344\t      - 0.195\n345\t    - - s025\n346\t      - 1.075\n347\t      - 1.1\n348\t      - 0.882\n349\t    - - s030\n350\t      - 3.155\n351\t      - 2.092\n352\t      - 2.35\n353\t  figures_description:\n354\t  - 'fig_qw_cross_benchmark.pdf: 与DS对应的QW三benchmark gradient曲线'\n355\t  analysis: 'QW在GPQA上完美复现单调递增模式。结合DS，两模型×三benchmark共6个 dose-response曲线全部单调（Spearman\n356\t    ρ=1.0）。QW-GPQA的gradient magnitude 与QW-GSM8K接近（s030: 2.35 vs 2.09），暗示QW在不同推理任务上的compound\n357\t    sensitivity较为稳定，而DS variation更大（MATH=8.48, GSM=4.68, GPQA=4.10）。\n358\t\n359\t    '\n360\t- name: GPQA Random Baselines and Strategy Specificity Ratio\n361\t  plan_id: gpqa_random_baselines\n362\t  description: '在GPQA-Diamond(n=50)上对DS和QW运行random masking across 4 sparsity levels，\n363\t    计算strategy specificity ratio (importance/random gradient)，验证≥5×。\n364\t\n365\t    '\n366\t  expected_results:\n367\t    ds_random:\n368\t      s015:\n369\t        median_gradient: 0.022\n370\t      s020:\n371\t        median_gradient: 0.068\n372\t      s025:\n373\t        median_gradient: 0.232\n374\t      s030:\n375\t        median_gradient: 0.548\n376\t    qw_random:\n377\t      s015:\n378\t        median_gradient: 0.006\n379\t      s020:\n380\t        median_gradient: 0.028\n381\t      s025:\n382\t        median_gradient: 0.125\n383\t      s030:\n384\t        median_gradient: 0.38\n385\t    strategy_specificity_ratio_ds:\n386\t      s015: 8.4\n387\t      s020: 8.6\n388\t      s025: 7.5\n389\t      s030: 7.5\n390\t    strategy_specificity_ratio_qw:\n391\t      s015: 7.0\n392\t      s020: 7.0\n393\t      s025: 7.1\n394\t      s030: 6.2\n395\t    strategy_specificity_ratio_range: 6.2-8.6×\n396\t    all_ratios_above_5x: true\n397\t    cross_benchmark_specificity_comparison:\n398\t      math500: 15-36×\n399\t      gsm8k: 2.3-3.8×\n400\t      gpqa: 6.2-8.6×\n401\t  result_rationale: 'Strategy specificity ratio的task-dependence与reasoning chain结构相关：\n402\t    (1) MATH-500推理链最长最复杂（竞赛数学），importance score的phase-dependent discrimination collapse最剧烈→ratio最高（15-36×）；\n403\t    (2) GSM8K推理链最短最规律（小学数学），importance和random的差异被压缩→ratio 最低（2.3-3.8×）； (3) GPQA居中（graduate\n404\t    QA，推理步骤中等长度），ratio 6.2-8.6×。 所有GPQA ratio≥5×，满足best tier阈值。物理解释：GPQA的scientific\n405\t    reasoning 涉及领域知识检索和逻辑链推理，importance score对这些pattern的编码比 random有明显优势，但不如MATH-500中复杂数学推理的优势大。\n406\t    random baseline在GPQA上仍产生可测量的compound effect（特别是s025+）， 但magnitude远小于importance——与DS/QW在MATH-500上的模式定性一致。\n407\t\n408\t    '\n409\t  tables:\n410\t  - name: 'Table: Strategy Specificity Ratio Across Benchmarks'\n411\t    columns:\n412\t    - benchmark\n413\t    - ratio_range\n414\t    - interpretation\n415\t    rows:\n416\t    - - MATH-500\n417\t      - 15-36×\n418\t      - very_high\n419\t    - - GPQA\n420\t      - 6.2-8.6×\n421\t      - high\n422\t    - - GSM8K\n423\t      - 2.3-3.8×\n424\t      - moderate\n425\t  figures_description:\n426\t  - 'fig_specificity_heatmap.pdf: 3×4 heatmap (benchmark × sparsity) 展示strategy specificity\n427\t    ratio，颜色从蓝(2×)到红(36×)，标注5×阈值线'\n428\t  - 'fig_gpqa_imp_vs_rand.pdf: GPQA上importance vs random gradient的双线图（DS和QW各一个panel），阴影区域表示两者差距'\n429\t  analysis: 'GPQA strategy specificity ratio 6.2-8.6×，全部超过5×阈值。 与MATH-500(15-36×)和GSM8K(2.3-3.8×)形成interpretable\n430\t    gradient： 推理链复杂度↑ → specificity ratio↑。这支持\"discrimination collapse是 mechanism、而非importance\n431\t    metric本身有缺陷\"的framing——如果是metric缺陷， ratio不应随task difficulty系统性变化。Strategy specificity的task-dependence\n432\t    机制现在有了三点数据（从moderate到very_high），可以在Discussion中 提出\"推理链复杂度调制specificity\"的初步假说。\n433\t\n434\t    '\n435\t- name: Discrimination Collapse Quantitative Correlation Analysis\n436\t  plan_id: mechanism_gini_correlation\n437\t  description: '利用已完成的c5_per_phase_gini和c2_n500数据，计算per-phase Gini_delta 与interaction\n438\t    severity（II median）的跨模型定量相关，验证r≥0.7。\n439\t\n440\t    '\n441\t  expected_results:\n442\t    analysis_type: correlation of per-phase Gini collapse magnitude with II severity\n443\t    data_source: c5_per_phase_gini (n=30 per model) + c2_n500 (n=500 per model)\n444\t    ds_within_model:\n445\t      gini_delta_low_phase:\n446\t      - -0.0163\n447\t      - -0.0209\n448\t      - -0.0313\n449\t      - -0.0373"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"57a0c9be-3448-41b8-a807-cd0aed32411d","uuid":"b48c8098-026d-4dc8-a4a2-08e5d8c587ac","timestamp":"2026-05-16T17:01:18.701Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0509_11/projects/phase-gated-compound-sparse/artifacts/dream_reports/dream_20260516T073742/best/imagined_experiments.yaml","content":"      - 0.012\n      - 0.108\n      s025:\n      - 0.055\n      - 0.28\n      s030:\n      - 0.18\n      - 0.62\n    wilcoxon_p:\n      s015: 0.018\n      s020: 0.004\n      s025: 0.00035\n      s030: 1.8e-05\n    wilcoxon_p_bonferroni:\n      s015: 0.072\n      s020: 0.016\n      s025: 0.0014\n      s030: 7.2e-05\n    significant_bonferroni:\n      s015: false\n      s020: true\n      s025: true\n      s030: true\n    bonferroni_significant_count: 3\n    cross_arch_comparison:\n      deepseek_qwen2_imp_vs_rand_dz_s030: 0.8\n      llama_imp_vs_rand_dz_s030: 0.52\n      delta: 0.28\n      note: 'LLaMA effect weaker than Qwen2 architecture but now unambiguously medium\n        (d_z=0.52, CI excludes zero). Architecture modulates magnitude but not direction\n        — strategy×phase interaction is a general phenomenon.\n\n        '\n  result_rationale: 'n=50时imp_vs_rand d_z=0.19→0.34，CI极宽（s030 CI=[0.06,0.66]），统计功效不足。\n    n=250使SE缩小√5≈2.24倍，效应量估计趋于真值。 关键推理：(1) n=50时random phase gradient d_z=0.35-0.44可能被采样变异性膨胀——\n    random masking本质是无差别噪声注入，不应产生与importance同等的strategy-dependent phase调制。在n=250下，采样噪声被平滑，random\n    d_z回落至~0.15-0.22，不再Bonferroni显著。 这与DS/QW在低sparsity下random NS的模式一致——n=50时LLaMA\n    random显著是Type I error 因小样本变异性所致。(2) importance的phase gradient在LLaMA上始终强烈（d_z≈1.0，\n    源于LLaMA架构的attention head数量28/层 vs Qwen2的28/层但GQA结构不同）， n=250确认这不是偶然。(3) imp_vs_rand\n    d_z在n=250下稳定至0.24→0.52， s020/s025/s030三个水平Bonferroni显著，因为真效应在这些水平上为medium（d_z≈0.35-0.55），\n    n=250给出>90%的功效。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table: LLaMA n=250 vs n=50 Effect Size Comparison'\n    columns:\n    - sparsity\n    - n50_dz\n    - n250_dz\n    - n250_bonf_p\n    - n250_significant\n    rows:\n    - - s015\n      - 0.19\n      - 0.24\n      - 0.072\n      - NS\n    - - s020\n      - 0.26\n      - 0.33\n      - 0.016\n      - ✓\n    - - s025\n      - 0.29\n      - 0.43\n      - 0.0014\n      - ✓\n    - - s030\n      - 0.34\n      - 0.52\n      - 7.2e-05\n      - ✓\n  - name: 'Table: Random Phase Gradient Attenuation (n=50 → n=250)'\n    columns:\n    - sparsity\n    - n50_random_dz\n    - n250_random_dz\n    - n250_random_CI_contains_zero\n    rows:\n    - - s015\n      - 0.35\n      - 0.15\n      - 'yes'\n    - - s020\n      - 0.37\n      - 0.18\n      - borderline\n    - - s025\n      - 0.45\n      - 0.21\n      - no (but not Bonf)\n    - - s030\n      - 0.44\n      - 0.22\n      - no (but not Bonf)\n  figures_description:\n  - 'fig_c8_n250_dz_comparison.pdf: 左panel=imp_vs_rand d_z随sparsity变化（n=50虚线 vs n=250实线，含CI\n    band），右panel=random phase gradient d_z的n=50→n=250衰减，灰色区域标注Bonferroni显著阈值'\n  - 'fig_c8_cross_arch_forest.pdf: Forest plot展示三架构(DS/QW/LLaMA)在4个sparsity水平的imp_vs_rand\n    d_z及95% CI'\n  analysis: 'LLaMA n=250结果解除了C8的architecture-dependent限定。三个关键变化： (1) imp_vs_rand d_z从n=50的仅s030\n    Bonferroni显著(p=0.029)提升至3个水平显著 (s020 p=0.016, s025 p=0.001, s030 p<0.001)； (2)\n    s030 d_z=0.52（medium effect），在best范围[0.4,0.65]内； (3) random phase gradient从d_z=0.35-0.44衰减至0.15-0.22，无一Bonferroni显著——\n    这与DS/QW模式一致，排除了\"LLaMA上random也strategy-dependent\"的alternative explanation。 论文可删除\"suggests\"/\"provides\n    partial support\"措辞，改为 \"Cross-architecture validation on LLaMA (n=250) confirms\n    strategy×phase interaction with medium effect size (d_z=0.52 at s=0.30, Bonferroni\n    p<0.001)\"。 Limitation仅保留magnitude差异（LLaMA d_z=0.52 vs Qwen2 d_z=0.80）。\n\n    '\n- name: GPQA DeepSeek Importance Phase Gradient Profiling\n  plan_id: gpqa_profiling_ds\n  description: '在DeepSeek-R1-Distill-Qwen-7B上对GPQA-Diamond子集(n=50)运行importance masking\n    across 4 sparsity levels (s015/s020/s025/s030)，验证phase gradient单调递增。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    model: DeepSeek-R1-Distill-Qwen-7B\n    benchmark: GPQA-Diamond\n    n_problems: 50\n    method: median + Wilcoxon + bootstrap_median(B=10000)\n    importance:\n      s015:\n        median_gradient: 0.185\n        ci_low: 0.062\n        ci_high: 0.385\n        wilcoxon_p: 0.0008\n      s020:\n        median_gradient: 0.582\n        ci_low: 0.241\n        ci_high: 0.935\n        wilcoxon_p: 0.0002\n      s025:\n        median_gradient: 1.748\n        ci_low: 0.82\n        ci_high: 2.51\n        wilcoxon_p: 0.0001\n      s030:\n        median_gradient: 4.105\n        ci_low: 1.89\n        ci_high: 8.82\n        wilcoxon_p: 0.0001\n    dose_response_monotonic: true\n    spearman_rho: 1.0\n    cross_benchmark_comparison:\n      math500_ds_gradient_s030: 8.48\n      gsm8k_ds_gradient_s030: 4.682\n      gpqa_ds_gradient_s030: 4.105\n      note: GPQA gradient magnitude between MATH-500 and GSM8K\n  result_rationale: 'GPQA-Diamond是graduate-level科学推理任务，难度高于MATH-500。预测phase gradient\n    单调递增的理由：(1) GPQA的reasoning chain通常较长（涉及多步科学推理）， 大量token落入low-sparsity phase——head\n    pruning在这些phase中导致importance score 的discrimination collapse更严重，compound interaction因此更大；\n    (2) DS在MATH-500上gradient为0.39→8.48，GSM8K上为0.241→4.682——GPQA预计 在两者之间（~0.19→4.10），因为GPQA虽然难度高但问题更短（多选题format），\n    reasoning chain长度介于MATH和GSM之间； (3) 单调性在三个benchmark上一致，因为phase gradient的物理机制（discrimination\n    collapse 在late phase最严重→compound interaction在low-sparsity phase最大）不依赖于task类型。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table: Cross-Benchmark Phase Gradient Comparison (DeepSeek)'\n    columns:\n    - sparsity\n    - MATH-500\n    - GSM8K\n    - GPQA\n    rows:\n    - - s015\n      - 0.39\n      - 0.241\n      - 0.185\n    - - s020\n      - 1.21\n      - 0.74\n      - 0.582\n    - - s025\n      - 3.99\n      - 1.992\n      - 1.748\n    - - s030\n      - 8.48\n      - 4.682\n      - 4.105\n  figures_description:\n  - 'fig_cross_benchmark_gradient.pdf: 三条线(MATH/GSM/GPQA)展示DS importance phase gradient随sparsity的dose-response曲线，标注均为单调递增'\n  analysis: 'GPQA上DS importance phase gradient 0.185→4.105单调递增，Spearman ρ=1.0， 复现了MATH-500和GSM8K上的核心发现。Gradient\n    magnitude介于MATH-500(8.48) 和GSM8K(4.682)之间，反映GPQA推理链长度的中间特性。 三benchmark全部单调递增（cross_benchmark_phase_gradient_monotonic_count=3），\n    确认phase modulation是跨task的robust finding。\n\n    '\n- name: GPQA Qwen Importance Phase Gradient Profiling\n  plan_id: gpqa_profiling_qw\n  description: '在Qwen2.5-7B-Instruct上对GPQA-Diamond(n=50)运行importance masking across\n    4 sparsity levels，验证cross-model replication。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    model: Qwen2.5-7B-Instruct\n    benchmark: GPQA-Diamond\n    n_problems: 50\n    importance:\n      s015:\n        median_gradient: 0.042\n        ci_low: 0.008\n        ci_high: 0.095\n        wilcoxon_p: 0.015\n      s020:\n        median_gradient: 0.195\n        ci_low: 0.078\n        ci_high: 0.358\n        wilcoxon_p: 0.0005\n      s025:\n        median_gradient: 0.882\n        ci_low: 0.45\n        ci_high: 1.32\n        wilcoxon_p: 0.0001\n      s030:\n        median_gradient: 2.35\n        ci_low: 1.28\n        ci_high: 3.68\n        wilcoxon_p: 0.0001\n    dose_response_monotonic: true\n    spearman_rho: 1.0\n    qw_ds_gradient_ratio_s030: 0.57\n    note: QW magnitude ~57% of DS, consistent with MATH-500 pattern (QW ~37% of DS)\n  result_rationale: 'QW在MATH-500上gradient为0.066→3.155（DS的~37%），在GSM8K上为0.039→2.092。\n    GPQA预测QW gradient 0.042→2.350，DS比QW比值约1.75×，略低于MATH-500的2.7×但 高于GSM8K的2.2×。QW\n    magnitude一贯小于DS（可能因Qwen2.5-7B-Instruct的 attention head utilization更均匀，pruning影响较分散），但方向和单调性完全一致。\n    Onset threshold仍在s020+——s015 gradient仅0.042但CI不跨零（GPQA难度使得即使 低sparsity也有可检测的compound\n    effect）。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table: Cross-Benchmark Phase Gradient Comparison (Qwen)'\n    columns:\n    - sparsity\n    - MATH-500\n    - GSM8K\n    - GPQA\n    rows:\n    - - s015\n      - 0.066\n      - 0.039\n      - 0.042\n    - - s020\n      - 0.307\n      - 0.158\n      - 0.195\n    - - s025\n      - 1.075\n      - 1.1\n      - 0.882\n    - - s030\n      - 3.155\n      - 2.092\n      - 2.35\n  figures_description:\n  - 'fig_qw_cross_benchmark.pdf: 与DS对应的QW三benchmark gradient曲线'\n  analysis: 'QW在GPQA上完美复现单调递增模式。结合DS，两模型×三benchmark共6个 dose-response曲线全部单调（Spearman\n    ρ=1.0）。QW-GPQA的gradient magnitude 与QW-GSM8K接近（s030: 2.35 vs 2.09），暗示QW在不同推理任务上的compound\n    sensitivity较为稳定，而DS variation更大（MATH=8.48, GSM=4.68, GPQA=4.10）。\n\n    '\n- name: GPQA Random Baselines and Strategy Specificity Ratio\n  plan_id: gpqa_random_baselines\n  description: '在GPQA-Diamond(n=50)上对DS和QW运行random masking across 4 sparsity levels，\n    计算strategy specificity ratio (importance/random gradient)，验证≥5×。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    ds_random:\n      s015:\n        median_gradient: 0.022\n      s020:\n        median_gradient: 0.068\n      s025:\n        median_gradient: 0.232\n      s030:\n        median_gradient: 0.548\n    qw_random:\n      s015:\n        median_gradient: 0.006\n      s020:\n        median_gradient: 0.028\n      s025:\n        median_gradient: 0.125\n      s030:\n        median_gradient: 0.38\n    strategy_specificity_ratio_ds:\n      s015: 8.4\n      s020: 8.6\n      s025: 7.5\n      s030: 7.5\n    strategy_specificity_ratio_qw:\n      s015: 7.0\n      s020: 7.0\n      s025: 7.1\n      s030: 6.2\n    strategy_specificity_ratio_range: 6.2-8.6×\n    all_ratios_above_5x: true\n    cross_benchmark_specificity_comparison:\n      math500: 15-36×\n      gsm8k: 2.3-3.8×\n      gpqa: 6.2-8.6×\n  result_rationale: 'Strategy specificity ratio的task-dependence与reasoning chain结构相关：\n    (1) MATH-500推理链最长最复杂（竞赛数学），importance score的phase-dependent discrimination collapse最剧烈→ratio最高（15-36×）；\n    (2) GSM8K推理链最短最规律（小学数学），importance和random的差异被压缩→ratio 最低（2.3-3.8×）； (3) GPQA居中（graduate\n    QA，推理步骤中等长度），ratio 6.2-8.6×。 所有GPQA ratio≥5×，满足best tier阈值。物理解释：GPQA的scientific\n    reasoning 涉及领域知识检索和逻辑链推理，importance score对这些pattern的编码比 random有明显优势，但不如MATH-500中复杂数学推理的优势大。\n    random baseline在GPQA上仍产生可测量的compound effect（特别是s025+）， 但magnitude远小于importance——与DS/QW在MATH-500上的模式定性一致。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table: Strategy Specificity Ratio Across Benchmarks'\n    columns:\n    - benchmark\n    - ratio_range\n    - interpretation\n    rows:\n    - - MATH-500\n      - 15-36×\n      - very_high\n    - - GPQA\n      - 6.2-8.6×\n      - high\n    - - GSM8K\n      - 2.3-3.8×\n      - moderate\n  figures_description:\n  - 'fig_specificity_heatmap.pdf: 3×4 heatmap (benchmark × sparsity) 展示strategy specificity\n    ratio，颜色从蓝(2×)到红(36×)，标注5×阈值线'\n  - 'fig_gpqa_imp_vs_rand.pdf: GPQA上importance vs random gradient的双线图（DS和QW各一个panel），阴影区域表示两者差距'\n  analysis: 'GPQA strategy specificity ratio 6.2-8.6×，全部超过5×阈值。 与MATH-500(15-36×)和GSM8K(2.3-3.8×)形成interpretable\n    gradient： 推理链复杂度↑ → specificity ratio↑。这支持\"discrimination collapse是 mechanism、而非importance\n    metric本身有缺陷\"的framing——如果是metric缺陷， ratio不应随task difficulty系统性变化。Strategy specificity的task-dependence\n    机制现在有了三点数据（从moderate到very_high），可以在Discussion中 提出\"推理链复杂度调制specificity\"的初步假说。\n\n    '\n- name: Discrimination Collapse Quantitative Correlation Analysis\n  plan_id: mechanism_gini_correlation\n  description: '利用已完成的c5_per_phase_gini和c2_n500数据，计算per-phase Gini_delta 与interaction\n    severity（II median）的跨模型定量相关，验证r≥0.7。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    analysis_type: correlation of per-phase Gini collapse magnitude with II severity\n    data_source: c5_per_phase_gini (n=30 per model) + c2_n500 (n=500 per model)\n    ds_within_model:\n      gini_delta_low_phase:\n      - -0.0163\n      - -0.0209\n      - -0.0313\n      - -0.0373","numLines":350,"startLine":100,"totalLines":703}}}
