{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_014TThGCDjbJZhUrgAYyaxye","type":"tool_result","content":"435\t- name: Discrimination Collapse Quantitative Correlation Analysis\n436\t  plan_id: mechanism_gini_correlation\n437\t  description: '利用已完成的c5_per_phase_gini和c2_n500数据，计算per-phase Gini_delta 与interaction\n438\t    severity（II median）的跨模型定量相关，验证r≥0.7。\n439\t\n440\t    '\n441\t  expected_results:\n442\t    analysis_type: correlation of per-phase Gini collapse magnitude with II severity\n443\t    data_source: c5_per_phase_gini (n=30 per model) + c2_n500 (n=500 per model)\n444\t    ds_within_model:\n445\t      gini_delta_low_phase:\n446\t      - -0.0163\n447\t      - -0.0209\n448\t      - -0.0313\n449\t      - -0.0373\n450\t      ii_median:\n451\t      - 0.3907\n452\t      - 1.2149\n453\t      - 3.9857\n454\t      - 8.4813\n455\t      spearman_rho: 1.0\n456\t      pearson_r: 0.93\n457\t      pearson_p: 0.035\n458\t    qw_within_model:\n459\t      gini_delta_low_phase:\n460\t      - -0.0165\n461\t      - -0.02\n462\t      - -0.0286\n463\t      - -0.035\n464\t      ii_median:\n465\t      - 0.0659\n466\t      - 0.3073\n467\t      - 1.0745\n468\t      - 3.155\n469\t      spearman_rho: 1.0\n470\t      pearson_r: 0.95\n471\t      pearson_p: 0.025\n472\t    cross_model_pooled:\n473\t      n_datapoints: 8\n474\t      spearman_rho: 0.88\n475\t      pearson_r: 0.85\n476\t      pearson_p: 0.004\n477\t    cv_correlation:\n478\t      ds_cv_delta_vs_ii_spearman: 1.0\n479\t      qw_cv_delta_vs_ii_spearman: 1.0\n480\t      cross_model_cv_pearson_r: 0.87\n481\t    llama_validation:\n482\t      note: 'LLaMA c8_llama_n250 data可进一步验证——如果LLaMA per-phase Gini也 与II monotonically相关，则三模型cross-model\n483\t        r预计提升至0.88+\n484\t\n485\t        '\n486\t      llama_predicted_gini_delta_low_phase:\n487\t      - -0.012\n488\t      - -0.016\n489\t      - -0.022\n490\t      - -0.028\n491\t      llama_predicted_ii_from_n250:\n492\t      - 0.025\n493\t      - 0.052\n494\t      - 0.148\n495\t      - 0.415\n496\t      llama_predicted_within_r: 0.91\n497\t  result_rationale: 'Gini delta和II的相关性有坚实的机制基础：head pruning → 剩余head的importance score分布变得更均匀（Gini下降）→\n498\t    importance-based eviction丧失判别力 → eviction近似随机 → compound interaction增大。因此Gini下降幅度应与II\n499\t    severity 正相关。具体地： (1) DS low-phase Gini delta [-0.016→-0.037] 与 II [0.39→8.48]\n500\t    完美单调共变 （Spearman ρ=1.0），Pearson r=0.93源于两者均近似幂律增长但指数不同； (2) QW同样单调（Gini [-0.017→-0.035]，II\n501\t    [0.066→3.155]），Pearson r略高(0.95) 因为QW的II增长更接近线性（log-scale上更平缓）； (3) 跨模型pooling(8点)r=0.85，因为DS和QW的Gini-magnitude关系有共同的正趋势\n502\t    但斜率不同（DS单位Gini下降对应更大的II增加），这正好反映两模型architecture 差异——Gini→II的传递函数是architecture-dependent的，但方向和monotonicity\n503\t    是universal的。 所有r>0.7，满足best tier要求。CV delta提供一致的supporting evidence。\n504\t\n505\t    '\n506\t  tables:\n507\t  - name: 'Table: Gini-II Correlation Summary'\n508\t    columns:\n509\t    - scope\n510\t    - Spearman ρ\n511\t    - Pearson r\n512\t    - p-value\n513\t    - interpretation\n514\t    rows:\n515\t    - - DS within-model\n516\t      - 1.0\n517\t      - 0.93\n518\t      - 0.035\n519\t      - strong monotonic\n520\t    - - QW within-model\n521\t      - 1.0\n522\t      - 0.95\n523\t      - 0.025\n524\t      - strong monotonic\n525\t    - - Cross-model pooled\n526\t      - 0.88\n527\t      - 0.85\n528\t      - 0.004\n529\t      - robust cross-model\n530\t  - name: 'Table: Per-Phase Gini Delta vs II Median (Low-Phase)'\n531\t    columns:\n532\t    - model\n533\t    - sparsity\n534\t    - gini_delta\n535\t    - ii_median\n536\t    rows:\n537\t    - - DS\n538\t      - s015\n539\t      - -0.0163\n540\t      - 0.3907\n541\t    - - DS\n542\t      - s020\n543\t      - -0.0209\n544\t      - 1.2149\n545\t    - - DS\n546\t      - s025\n547\t      - -0.0313\n548\t      - 3.9857\n549\t    - - DS\n550\t      - s030\n551\t      - -0.0373\n552\t      - 8.4813\n553\t    - - QW\n554\t      - s015\n555\t      - -0.0165\n556\t      - 0.0659\n557\t    - - QW\n558\t      - s020\n559\t      - -0.02\n560\t      - 0.3073\n561\t    - - QW\n562\t      - s025\n563\t      - -0.0286\n564\t      - 1.0745\n565\t    - - QW\n566\t      - s030\n567\t      - -0.035\n568\t      - 3.155\n569\t  figures_description:\n570\t  - 'fig_gini_ii_scatter.pdf: 散点图展示|Gini_delta|(x轴) vs II_median(y轴,log scale)，DS圆点QW方块，按sparsity着色（浅→深），回归线及r²标注'\n571\t  - 'fig_mechanism_schematic.pdf: 因果链示意图：head pruning → Gini↓ → discrimination collapse\n572\t    → compound II↑，箭头上标注cross-model r值'\n573\t  analysis: 'Per-phase Gini delta与II severity的定量相关是discrimination collapse假说的 最终实证验证。DS和QW各4个sparsity水平给出8个数据点，跨模型Pearson\n574\t    r=0.85, Spearman ρ=0.88，远超r≥0.7阈值。更重要的是： (1) 两模型within-model ρ均为1.0（完美单调），排除了\"Gini下降但II不增加\"\n575\t    或\"II增加但Gini不下降\"的反例； (2) Pearson r<1.0源于非线性关系（II随Gini近似幂律增长），这恰好与 discrimination\n576\t    collapse机制的非线性传递函数一致——Gini小幅下降在接近 临界阈值时引发不成比例的判别力崩塌； (3) CV delta给出一致结果（r=0.87），提供converging\n577\t    evidence。 论文§5 Mechanism可以声明\"Gini decline quantitatively predicts interaction\n578\t    severity (cross-model r=0.85, p=0.004)\"。\n579\t\n580\t    '\n581\t- name: Language Switching at Intermediate Sparsities (s020/s025)\n582\t  plan_id: c10_lang_s020_s025\n583\t  description: '填补s020和s025的language switching rate数据（当前已有dense=0%, s015=4%, s030=40%），确认monotonic\n584\t    dose-response。\n585\t\n586\t    '\n587\t  expected_results:\n588\t    method: CPU analysis of gen_snippet data\n589\t    n_per_sparsity: 50\n590\t    s020:\n591\t      switch_rate: 0.12\n592\t      cn_count: 6\n593\t      en_count: 44\n594\t      cn_acc: 0.0\n595\t      en_acc: 0.3\n596\t    s025:\n597\t      switch_rate: 0.26\n598\t      cn_count: 13\n599\t      en_count: 37\n600\t      cn_acc: 0.077\n601\t      en_acc: 0.108\n602\t    full_dose_response:\n603\t      dense: 0.0\n604\t      s015: 0.04\n605\t      s020: 0.12\n606\t      s025: 0.26\n607\t      s030: 0.4\n608\t    monotonic: true\n609\t    spearman_rho: 1.0\n610\t  result_rationale: 'Language switching是compound sparsity的behavioral symptom——DeepSeek-R1-Distill\n611\t    在中文语料上训练，severe compound degradation使模型退回到训练时更frequent的 中文pattern。剂量-响应关系应当单调：\n612\t    (1) dense→s015: 仅2/50切换（4%），compound effect极轻，几乎不影响language control； (2) s020:\n613\t    预测12%（6/50），compound interaction开始可测（II median=1.21）， 部分问题的reasoning chain中出现中文片段；\n614\t    (3) s025: 预测26%（13/50），II=3.99的compound degradation显著干扰language control； (4) s030:\n615\t    已观察40%（20/50），与II=8.48一致。 递增模式跟随II的dose-response曲线（ρ=1.0），为compound degradation的\n616\t    behavioral manifestation提供独立evidence。\n617\t\n618\t    '\n619\t  tables:\n620\t  - name: 'Table: Language Switching Dose-Response'\n621\t    columns:\n622\t    - sparsity\n623\t    - switch_rate\n624\t    - cn_count\n625\t    - cn_acc\n626\t    - en_acc\n627\t    - II_median\n628\t    rows:\n629\t    - - dense\n630\t      - 0%\n631\t      - 0\n632\t      - n/a\n633\t      - 0.52\n634\t      - 0"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"57a0c9be-3448-41b8-a807-cd0aed32411d","uuid":"89c345d0-abea-479b-a67f-4baf75d37f36","timestamp":"2026-05-16T17:01:26.908Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0509_11/projects/phase-gated-compound-sparse/artifacts/dream_reports/dream_20260516T073742/best/imagined_experiments.yaml","content":"- name: Discrimination Collapse Quantitative Correlation Analysis\n  plan_id: mechanism_gini_correlation\n  description: '利用已完成的c5_per_phase_gini和c2_n500数据，计算per-phase Gini_delta 与interaction\n    severity（II median）的跨模型定量相关，验证r≥0.7。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    analysis_type: correlation of per-phase Gini collapse magnitude with II severity\n    data_source: c5_per_phase_gini (n=30 per model) + c2_n500 (n=500 per model)\n    ds_within_model:\n      gini_delta_low_phase:\n      - -0.0163\n      - -0.0209\n      - -0.0313\n      - -0.0373\n      ii_median:\n      - 0.3907\n      - 1.2149\n      - 3.9857\n      - 8.4813\n      spearman_rho: 1.0\n      pearson_r: 0.93\n      pearson_p: 0.035\n    qw_within_model:\n      gini_delta_low_phase:\n      - -0.0165\n      - -0.02\n      - -0.0286\n      - -0.035\n      ii_median:\n      - 0.0659\n      - 0.3073\n      - 1.0745\n      - 3.155\n      spearman_rho: 1.0\n      pearson_r: 0.95\n      pearson_p: 0.025\n    cross_model_pooled:\n      n_datapoints: 8\n      spearman_rho: 0.88\n      pearson_r: 0.85\n      pearson_p: 0.004\n    cv_correlation:\n      ds_cv_delta_vs_ii_spearman: 1.0\n      qw_cv_delta_vs_ii_spearman: 1.0\n      cross_model_cv_pearson_r: 0.87\n    llama_validation:\n      note: 'LLaMA c8_llama_n250 data可进一步验证——如果LLaMA per-phase Gini也 与II monotonically相关，则三模型cross-model\n        r预计提升至0.88+\n\n        '\n      llama_predicted_gini_delta_low_phase:\n      - -0.012\n      - -0.016\n      - -0.022\n      - -0.028\n      llama_predicted_ii_from_n250:\n      - 0.025\n      - 0.052\n      - 0.148\n      - 0.415\n      llama_predicted_within_r: 0.91\n  result_rationale: 'Gini delta和II的相关性有坚实的机制基础：head pruning → 剩余head的importance score分布变得更均匀（Gini下降）→\n    importance-based eviction丧失判别力 → eviction近似随机 → compound interaction增大。因此Gini下降幅度应与II\n    severity 正相关。具体地： (1) DS low-phase Gini delta [-0.016→-0.037] 与 II [0.39→8.48]\n    完美单调共变 （Spearman ρ=1.0），Pearson r=0.93源于两者均近似幂律增长但指数不同； (2) QW同样单调（Gini [-0.017→-0.035]，II\n    [0.066→3.155]），Pearson r略高(0.95) 因为QW的II增长更接近线性（log-scale上更平缓）； (3) 跨模型pooling(8点)r=0.85，因为DS和QW的Gini-magnitude关系有共同的正趋势\n    但斜率不同（DS单位Gini下降对应更大的II增加），这正好反映两模型architecture 差异——Gini→II的传递函数是architecture-dependent的，但方向和monotonicity\n    是universal的。 所有r>0.7，满足best tier要求。CV delta提供一致的supporting evidence。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table: Gini-II Correlation Summary'\n    columns:\n    - scope\n    - Spearman ρ\n    - Pearson r\n    - p-value\n    - interpretation\n    rows:\n    - - DS within-model\n      - 1.0\n      - 0.93\n      - 0.035\n      - strong monotonic\n    - - QW within-model\n      - 1.0\n      - 0.95\n      - 0.025\n      - strong monotonic\n    - - Cro