{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_016Mi5giSZyqZZbVewCgzeop","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Now I have the complete picture of the best-tier predictions. I need to generate the worst-tier predictions for the same set of experiments. Let me list all the experiments from the best-tier report:\n\n1. LLaMA n=250 Cross-Architecture Full Validation (c8_llama_n250_fixed)\n2. GPQA DeepSeek Importance Phase Gradient Profiling (gpqa_profiling_ds)\n3. GPQA Qwen Importance Phase Gradient Profiling (gpqa_profiling_qw)\n4. GPQA Random Baselines and Strategy Specificity Ratio (gpqa_random_baselines)\n\n\n5. Discrimination Collapse Quantitative Correlation Analysis (mechanism_gini_correlation)\n6. Language Switching at Intermediate Sparsities (c10_lang_s020_s025)\n7. C9 Related Work Differentiation (c9_related_work)\n\nI notice that c10_lang_s020_s025 already has actual results in the registry showing switch rates and accuracy values at different sparsity levels, so I'll include those real data points but still generate worst-tier predictions for the remaining experiments.\n\nLooking at the current experiment status, most of what I thought were planned experiments have actually completed with metrics. The ones still actively running or queued are c8_llama_n250_fixed and the gpqa_ds_importance variants, while the mechanism_gini_correlation analysis and c9_related_work writing tasks haven't started yet.\n\nFor the worst-case scenario predictions, I need to generate data for all experiments in the plan, not just the incomplete ones—the user wants me to imagine adverse outcomes across the board, even for the ones that have already finished.\n\nLooking back at their request more carefully, they're asking for predictions on the \"planned\" experiments from the experiment_plan. Since all the experiments listed there are marked as DONE, they must be referring to the broader set of experiments that were outlined in the best-tier scenario—the ones that are either still running or haven't started yet.\n\nSo I'll create worst-tier predictions for the same seven experiments: c8_llama_n250_fixed, gpqa_profiling_ds, gpqa_profiling_qw, gpqa_random_baselines, mechanism_gini_correlation, c10_lang_s020_s025, and c9_related_work. This gives a natural parallel to the best-tier report.\n\nNow I'm constructing the worst-case predictions, starting with c8_llama_n250_fixed. LaMA n=250\n\n**Worst tier prediction:**\n- imp_vs_rand d_z stays below 0.20 at all sparsity levels (n=250 confirms n=50 was NOT underpowered, the effect really is negligible)\n- Random phase gradient remains significant (d_z 0.30-0.40, CI excluding zero) even at n=250\n- Only 0 or 1 conditions Bonferroni significant for imp_vs_rand\n- Interpretation: phase gradient is universal (not strategy-specific), strategy×phase interaction is architecture-specific at best\n\n### 2. gpqa_profiling_ds - GPQA DS Importance\n\n**Worst tier prediction:**\n- Phase gradient may be non-monotonic (e.g., s020 > s025 or s025 drop)\n- Gradient magnitudes very small (much smaller than GSM8K)\n- imp/rand ratio ≈ 1.0-1.5 (no strategy specificity on GPQA)\n- Wilcoxon p may not survive Bonferroni at lower sparsities\n\n### 3. gpqa_profiling_qw - GPQA QW Importance\n\n**Worst tier prediction:**\n- Similar to DS: weak or non-monotonic gradient\n- QW effect even smaller than DS (as usual)\n- s015 definitely NS, s020 probably NS\n\n### 4. gpqa_random_baselines\n\n**Worst tier prediction:**\n- Random shows comparable phase gradient to importance on GPQA\n- Strategy specificity ratio ≈ 1.0-1.5×\n- GPQA effectively has no strategy specificity\n\n### 5. mechanism_gini_correlation\n\n**Worst tier prediction:**\n- Within-model Spearman still ρ=1.0 with just 4 points, so the correlation structure is holding but the sample size is tiny\n\n. Pearson r drops because the Gini-II relationship is noisy. Cross-model pooled r drops below 0.7, and LLaMA adds noise that weakens the overall correlation.\n\n### 6. c10_lang_s020_s025 (DONE)\n\nThis one's actually complete. The actual results show s020 switch_rate=0.14 and s025 switch_rate=0.32, which fits a monotonic dose-response pattern (0→0.04→0.14→0.32→0.40), so there's no real \"worst\" outcome here—it already worked. For the worst tier, I'd predict a reviewer might dismiss language switching as anecdotal or peripheral to the main contribution.\n\n### 7. c9_\n\nrelated_work\n\nNow I'm thinking through the worst-case scenario for this section. The main risk is that 2+ reviewers find the positioning unconvincing, especially if they see the KV Cache physics paper as having already established the phase-dependent compression narrative. They could view this as just another confirmation of known results, making novelty seem insufficient for EMNLP. With those reviewer score ranges and low acceptance probability, I need to frame the core claim more carefully—it shrinks from a \"finding paper\" to more of a methodology contribution.\n\nGenerating YAML output...\n\nFor the worst case with c8_llama_n250_fixed, I'm looking at how the effect sizes change as sample size increases. At n=50, the improvement versus random showed effect sizes around 0.19-0.34, while random baseline was 0.35-0.44. At n=250, I'd expect the random effect to stabilize somewhere in the 0.30-0.38 range, still showing significance but with tighter confidence intervals.\n\nThe improvement versus random effect should shrink considerably at larger sample sizes—settling into the 0.10-0.19 range across different seeds. With the confidence interval width narrowing by roughly a factor of 2.24 when moving from n=50 to n=250, I can estimate tighter bounds around these point estimates. Let me recalculate the n=50 values I was working with to make sure the progression is consistent. These worst-case estimates suggest that random phase gradients are actually stronger than the importance-versus-random difference on LLaMA, which would undermine the strategy specificity hypothesis. Now I'm thinking through the GPQA predictions—with n=198 covering all Diamond problems, the importance gradient could be monotonic but extremely weak, or even non-monotonic with reversals at different sparsity levels, while random baselines might show comparable or stronger gradients. The key uncertainty is whether DeepSeek-R1-Distill actually engages extended reasoning on multiple-choice GPQA tasks the way it does on MATH-500's long-form chain-of-thought format.\n\nFor the mechanism_gini_correlation worst case, the within-model correlations are trivially ρ=1.0 since both metrics are monotonic by construction across the sparsity sweep, though Pearson r could dip lower if the relationship becomes nonlinear. Cross-model pooled correlations face a different constraint—I need to think through what happens when combining data across models with limited samples.\n\nWith only 8 points total, LLaMA's distinctly different magnitude pattern could severely disrupt the correlation. If LLaMA shows Gini deltas comparable to DeepSeek and Qwen but with much smaller II values, the cross-model Pearson correlation could plummet to around 0.45-0.55, which wouldn't meet the bar for a publishable quantitative prediction.\n\nFor c10_lang_s020_s025, I have actual results to work with. The switch rates show a clean monotonic progression from 0.04 to 0.14 to 0.32 to 0.40, but reviewers might dismiss this as a DeepSeek-specific quirk tied to its bilingual training rather than evidence of a general compound effect.\n\nOn the novelty front, I'm anticipating pushback—reviewers will likely cite Physics of KV Cache as having already characterized the core phenomenon, and HIES for identifying score collapse, making our contribution look like a straightforward application of known effects to a new setting. For the simulated reviews, I'm sketching out three perspectives: one challenging novelty directly, another questioning the scope given we're working with 7B models and limited benchmarks, and a third arguing that the strategy specificity claim breaks down on LLaMA with GPQA. Now I need to structure this into YAML and decide whether to include an explicit simulated review section like the best-tier report did.\n\nI'm pulling together the worst-tier metric ranges to ensure consistency across all seven experiments—the key numbers are the reviewer scores clustering around 2.3-3.0, novelty challenges hitting 2-3 times, and acceptance probability staying low at 0.05-0.2. Let me write out the full YAML with these constraints in mind.","signature":""}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1319,"cache_read_input_tokens":100305,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1319},"output_tokens":8,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"57a0c9be-3448-41b8-a807-cd0aed32411d","uuid":"a83e168f-9cab-4d7e-8b2c-b8b29c8931cb"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_016Mi5giSZyqZZbVewCgzeop","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Now I have the full picture. I have the best-tier dream report structure and all current registry data. Let me construct the worst-tier predictions.\n\n```yaml\ntier: worst\nnarrative_guidance: >\n  Strategy specificity 在新 benchmark/architecture 上消失。LLaMA n=250 确认 imp_vs_rand d_z\n  < 0.20（不是 n=50 功效不足——真效应就是 negligible），random phase gradient 在 LLaMA 上持续显著\n  （d_z 0.30+, CI 排除零），表明 phase gradient 是 universal phenomenon 而非 strategy-specific。\n  GPQA 上 importance gradient 可能仍单调但极弱，且 random 也展示类似 magnitude → imp/rand ratio\n  ≈ 1.0-1.5，无 strategy specificity。2+ reviewer 判 novelty insufficient：Physics of KV Cache\n  已刻画 phase-dependent compression behavior，HIES 已发现 score collapse，本文仅在 compound setting\n  中复现已知效应。核心 reframe：从 'finding paper' 转向 'methodology + diagnostic framework'——\n  提出 Interaction Index (II) 作为 compound compression 的标准化诊断指标，证明 per-problem paired\n  bootstrap + phase-stratified analysis 能揭示 aggregate metrics 掩盖的 heterogeneity。Phase gradient\n  定位为 'robust phenomenon'（importance 内部始终 d_z>1.0），strategy specificity 降级为\n  'one manifestation that varies by context, not the core contribution'。Related Work\n  不再与 Physics of KV Cache 竞争 'phase' narrative，而定位为 complementary。\n\nimagined_experiments:\n  - name: \"LLaMA n=250 Cross-Architecture Full Validation\"\n    plan_id: \"c8_llama_n250_fixed\"\n    description: >\n      在 DeepSeek-R1-Distill-Llama-8B 上扩展至 n=250，8 条件（importance/random × s015-s030）。\n      Worst 预测：imp_vs_rand d_z 全部 < 0.20，random phase gradient 持续显著。\n    expected_results:\n      model: DeepSeek-R1-Distill-Llama-8B\n      n_problems: 250\n      n_valid: 244\n      n_skipped: 6\n      conditions_completed: 8/8\n      n_bootstrap: 10000\n      bonferroni_k: 4\n      imp_vs_rand_dz:\n        s015: 0.10\n        s020: 0.12\n        s025: 0.15\n        s030: 0.18\n      imp_vs_rand_dz_ci:\n        s015: [-0.03, 0.23]\n        s020: [-0.01, 0.25]\n        s025: [0.02, 0.28]\n        s030: [0.05, 0.31]\n      imp_vs_rand_dz_interpretation:\n        s015: negligible\n        s020: negligible\n        s025: negligible\n        s030: negligible\n      imp_vs_rand_dz_monotonic: true\n      phase_gradient_importance_dz:\n        s015: 0.95\n        s020: 1.05\n        s025: 1.08\n        s030: 0.98\n      phase_gradient_importance_dz_ci:\n        s015: [0.75, 1.15]\n        s020: [0.87, 1.23]\n        s025: [0.90, 1.26]\n        s030: [0.82, 1.14]\n      phase_gradient_importance_interpretation: all_large\n      phase_gradient_random_dz:\n        s015: 0.30\n        s020: 0.33\n        s025: 0.38\n        s030: 0.36\n      phase_gradient_random_dz_ci:\n        s015: [0.13, 0.47]\n        s020: [0.16, 0.50]\n        s025: [0.21, 0.55]\n        s030: [0.19, 0.53]\n      phase_gradient_random_interpretation: all_small_but_significant\n      median_diff:\n        s015: 0.012\n        s020: 0.018\n        s025: 0.055\n        s030: 0.145\n      median_diff_ci:\n        s015: [-0.005, 0.032]\n        s020: [-0.028, 0.070]\n        s025: [-0.020, 0.155]\n        s030: [-0.035, 0.310]\n      wilcoxon_p:\n        s015: 0.135\n        s020: 0.098\n        s025: 0.052\n        s030: 0.028\n      wilcoxon_p_bonferroni:\n        s015: 0.540\n        s020: 0.392\n        s025: 0.208\n        s030: 0.112\n      significant_bonferroni:\n        s015: false\n        s020: false\n        s025: false\n        s030: false\n      bonferroni_significant_count: 0\n      cross_arch_comparison:\n        deepseek_qwen2_imp_vs_rand_dz_s030: 0.80\n        llama_imp_vs_rand_dz_s030: 0.18\n        delta: 0.62\n        note: >\n          LLaMA imp_vs_rand d_z=0.18 远低于 Qwen2 架构的 0.80。Strategy × phase interaction\n          在 LLaMA 上 effectively absent——importance 和 random 均展示 phase gradient，差异\n          不足以达到统计显著。Strategy specificity 是 architecture-dependent 而非 universal。\n    result_rationale: >\n      n=50 时 imp_vs_rand d_z=0.19→0.34 反映了小样本噪声膨胀——CI 极宽（s030: [0.06,0.66]），\n      真值可能在区间下端。n=250 将 SE 缩小 √5≈2.24 倍，效应量估计趋于真值。关键推理：\n      (1) LLaMA 架构（standard MHA, 32 heads/layer）的 attention head 冗余结构不同于 Qwen2\n      的 GQA——pruning 后 importance score 的 phase-dependent 行为在两种架构上定性不同。LLaMA\n      的均匀 head 分布使得 pruning 对 importance score discrimination 的影响在各 phase 间更对称，\n      importance 和 random 的差异缩小。\n      (2) n=50 时 random phase gradient d_z=0.35-0.44 不是 Type I error——LLaMA 的 attention\n      redistribution 模式确实使 random masking 也产生 phase-dependent compound effect。n=250\n      确认 random d_z 稳定在 0.30-0.38（CI 排除零），这与 DS/QW 在低 sparsity 下 random NS\n      的模式定性不同，是 LLaMA 架构的 genuine 特征。\n      (3) 结果是 imp_vs_rand d_z 收缩至 0.10-0.18，全部低于 medium effect 阈值，0 个\n      Bonferroni 显著。Phase gradient 在 importance 内强烈（d_z≈1.0），但这是 universal 的\n      phase effect，不是 strategy-specific interaction——random 也显示 d_z 0.30-0.38 的\n      non-trivial gradient。核心 C1 framing \"'severity is strategy×phase emergent'\" 在\n      LLaMA 上不成立，须降级为 \"'phase gradient is universal, strategy modulation is\n      architecture-dependent'\"。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: LLaMA n=250 vs n=50 Effect Size Comparison\"\n        columns: [sparsity, n50_dz, n250_dz, n250_bonf_p, n250_significant]\n        rows:\n          - [s015, 0.19, 0.10, 0.540, \"NS\"]\n          - [s020, 0.26, 0.12, 0.392, \"NS\"]\n          - [s025, 0.29, 0.15, 0.208, \"NS\"]\n          - [s030, 0.34, 0.18, 0.112, \"NS\"]\n      - name: \"Table: Random Phase Gradient Persistence (n=50 → n=250)\"\n        columns: [sparsity, n50_random_dz, n250_random_dz, n250_random_CI_excludes_zero]\n        rows:\n          - [s015, 0.35, 0.30, \"yes\"]\n          - [s020, 0.37, 0.33, \"yes\"]\n          - [s025, 0.45, 0.38, \"yes\"]\n          - [s030, 0.44, 0.36, \"yes\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - >\n        fig_c8_n250_worst.pdf: 左 panel=imp_vs_rand d_z 随 sparsity 变化（n=50 虚线 vs\n        n=250 实线，含 CI band），所有 n=250 点 CI 含零或 borderline。右 panel=importance\n        vs random phase gradient d_z 在 n=250 下的对比——两者 CI 大量重叠，importance\n        略高但差异不显著。灰色虚线标注 medium effect 阈值 d_z=0.4。\n    analysis: >\n      LLaMA n=250 确认 strategy×phase interaction 在 LLaMA 架构上 effectively absent。\n      n=50 的 d_z=0.34 (s030) 是小样本噪声膨胀，真值 d_z=0.18（negligible）。更关键的是，\n      random phase gradient 在 n=250 下仍显著（d_z 0.30-0.38），且 CI 排除零——这与\n      DeepSeek/Qwen 上 random 低 sparsity NS 的模式定性不同。解读：phase gradient 是\n      universal phenomenon（importance 和 random 均展示），strategy specificity 是\n      architecture-dependent 的——仅在 Qwen2 架构上稳健，LLaMA 上不成立。\n      论文必须将 C8 从 \"partially_confirmed\" 改为 \"architecture-dependent\"，Abstract/Intro\n      不能声明 \"strategy×phase interaction generalizes across architectures\"。\n      Framing 修改：phase gradient 作为 robust universal finding（三架构均 d_z>0.9 for\n      importance），strategy specificity 作为 Qwen2-specific observation that requires\n      further investigation across architectures。\n\n  - name: \"GPQA DeepSeek Importance Phase Gradient Profiling\"\n    plan_id: \"gpqa_profiling_ds\"\n    description: >\n      在 DeepSeek-R1-Distill-Qwen-7B 上对 GPQA-Diamond (n≤198) 运行 importance masking\n      across 4 sparsity levels。Worst 预测：gradient 非单调或极弱。\n    expected_results:\n      model: DeepSeek-R1-Distill-Qwen-7B\n      benchmark: GPQA-Diamond\n      n_problems: 198\n      mid_null_rate: 0.42\n      effective_n: 115\n      method: median + Wilcoxon + bootstrap_median(B=10000)\n      importance:\n        s015:\n          median_gradient: 0.068\n          ci_low: -0.015\n          ci_high: 0.182\n          wilcoxon_p: 0.085\n        s020:\n          median_gradient: 0.195\n          ci_low: 0.042\n          ci_high: 0.405\n          wilcoxon_p: 0.012\n        s025:\n          median_gradient: 0.312\n          ci_low: 0.085\n          ci_high: 0.622\n          wilcoxon_p: 0.005\n        s030:\n          median_gradient: 0.855\n          ci_low: 0.285\n          ci_high: 1.680\n          wilcoxon_p: 0.001\n      dose_response_monotonic: true\n      spearman_rho: 1.0\n      cross_benchmark_comparison:\n        math500_ds_gradient_s030: 8.48\n        gsm8k_ds_gradient_s030: 4.682\n        gpqa_ds_gradient_s030: 0.855\n        ratio_math_to_gpqa: 9.9\n        note: >\n          GPQA gradient magnitude 仅为 MATH-500 的 ~10%，远低于 GSM8K。GPQA 多选题格式\n          导致 reasoning chain 短（平均 ~300 tokens vs MATH-500 ~1200 tokens），low-sparsity\n          phase token 极少，phase gradient 被压缩。\n    result_rationale: >\n      GPQA-Diamond 是 graduate-level 多选题，格式决定了 reasoning chain 远短于 MATH-500。\n      DeepSeek-R1-Distill-Qwen-7B 对 GPQA 的生成通常 300-600 tokens（vs MATH-500 的\n      800-2000 tokens），且 <think> 段落较短（多选题不需要长推理链）。这导致：\n      (1) Phase segmentation 后 low-sparsity phase 包含的 token 很少，mid phase 高 null rate\n      （~42%），compound interaction 的 phase-dependent 放大效应被稀释；\n      (2) Gradient magnitude 仅 0.068→0.855——虽然单调但 s030 仅 0.855，不到 MATH-500\n      的 1/10。物理原因：短 reasoning chain 意味着 head pruning 对 importance score\n      discrimination 的影响没有足够的 token 累积来放大 compound effect；\n      (3) s015 的 CI 跨零（p=0.085），Bonferroni 后更不显著——GPQA 在低 sparsity 下\n      compound effect 不可检测。Dose-response 虽然技术上单调（ρ=1.0），但 absolute\n      magnitude 太小，reviewer 会质疑 practical significance。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Cross-Benchmark Phase Gradient Comparison (DeepSeek)\"\n        columns: [sparsity, MATH-500, GSM8K, GPQA]\n        rows:\n          - [s015, 0.39, 0.241, 0.068]\n          - [s020, 1.21, 0.740, 0.195]\n          - [s025, 3.99, 1.992, 0.312]\n          - [s030, 8.48, 4.682, 0.855]\n    figures_description:\n      - >\n        fig_cross_benchmark_gradient_worst.pdf: 三条线(MATH/GSM/GPQA)展示 DS importance\n        phase gradient。GPQA 曲线几乎贴近 x 轴，与 MATH-500 差距巨大。Y 轴 log scale\n        使三条线可见但 GPQA gradient 在 linear scale 上 visually trivial。\n    analysis: >\n      GPQA gradient 技术上单调但 magnitude 极弱（s030 仅 0.855 vs MATH-500 的 8.48），\n      构成 \"effect disappears on different tasks\" 的叙事风险。Reviewer 会解读为：\n      phase gradient 的 magnitude 是 task-dependent 的，MATH-500 上的强效应可能是\n      overfitting to one specific benchmark 的 reasoning chain 结构。加上 GSM8K 已显示\n      衰减（4.68），GPQA 进一步衰减至 <1，趋势指向 \"effect diminishes as task changes\"。\n      Reframe：phase gradient 方向一致但 magnitude task-dependent，强调方向 robustness\n      而非 magnitude，将 magnitude variation 归因于 reasoning chain length differences\n      （可量化：MATH ~1200 tok, GSM ~400 tok, GPQA ~300 tok）。\n\n  - name: \"GPQA Qwen Importance Phase Gradient Profiling\"\n    plan_id: \"gpqa_profiling_qw\"\n    description: >\n      在 Qwen2.5-7B-Instruct 上对 GPQA-Diamond 运行 importance masking，验证 cross-model。\n      Worst 预测：QW 效应更弱，s015/s020 NS。\n    expected_results:\n      model: Qwen2.5-7B-Instruct\n      benchmark: GPQA-Diamond\n      n_problems: 198\n      mid_null_rate: 0.55\n      effective_n: 89\n      importance:\n        s015:\n          median_gradient: 0.012\n          ci_low: -0.025\n          ci_high: 0.058\n          wilcoxon_p: 0.32\n        s020:\n          median_gradient: 0.048\n          ci_low: -0.008\n          ci_high: 0.125\n          wilcoxon_p: 0.078\n        s025:\n          median_gradient: 0.185\n          ci_low: 0.035\n          ci_high: 0.405\n          wilcoxon_p: 0.008\n        s030:\n          median_gradient: 0.520\n          ci_low: 0.145\n          ci_high: 1.050\n          wilcoxon_p: 0.002\n      dose_response_monotonic: true\n      spearman_rho: 1.0\n      qw_ds_gradient_ratio_s030: 0.61\n      note: >\n        QW gradient ~61% of DS（与 MATH-500 pattern 一致），但 absolute magnitude\n        极小——s030 仅 0.52，s015/s020 CI 含零。\n    result_rationale: >\n      QW 在 MATH-500 上 gradient 为 DS 的 ~37%（3.155 vs 8.48），在 GSM8K 上约 45%\n      （2.092 vs 4.682）。GPQA 上预测 QW ~61% of DS。QW 的 attention head utilization\n      更均匀，pruning 影响更分散，compound interaction 更弱。GPQA 短 reasoning chain\n      进一步压缩效应。s015 和 s020 的 gradient 极小（0.012 和 0.048），CI 含零，不可靠。\n      高 mid_null_rate（55%）反映 QW 在 GPQA 上的 reasoning chain 更短更不稳定——many\n      problems 的 mid phase 基本为空。仅 s025/s030 Wilcoxon 显著，但 Bonferroni k=4\n      后 s025 borderline。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Cross-Benchmark Phase Gradient Comparison (Qwen)\"\n        columns: [sparsity, MATH-500, GSM8K, GPQA]\n        rows:\n          - [s015, 0.066, 0.039, 0.012]\n          - [s020, 0.307, 0.158, 0.048]\n          - [s025, 1.075, 1.100, 0.185]\n          - [s030, 3.155, 2.092, 0.520]\n    figures_description:\n      - >\n        fig_qw_cross_benchmark_worst.pdf: QW 三 benchmark gradient 曲线。GPQA 几乎平坦，\n        与 MATH-500/GSM8K 差距明显。\n    analysis: >\n      QW GPQA gradient s030=0.52，不到 MATH-500 的 1/6。Cross-model replication 方向一致\n      但 magnitude 进一步衰减。两模型 × 三 benchmark 的 gradient magnitude 矩阵显示\n      明确的 task-dependence：MATH-500 >> GSM8K >> GPQA。Reviewer 会用此论证 \"phase\n      gradient magnitude is primarily driven by reasoning chain length, not a fundamental\n      property of compound compression\"——如果效应量完全由 chain length 解释，则贡献\n      降级为 trivial observation。\n\n  - name: \"GPQA Random Baselines and Strategy Specificity Ratio\"\n    plan_id: \"gpqa_random_baselines\"\n    description: >\n      在 GPQA-Diamond 上对 DS 和 QW 运行 random masking，计算 strategy specificity ratio。\n      Worst 预测：ratio ≈ 1.0-1.5，无 strategy specificity。\n    expected_results:\n      ds_random:\n        s015:\n          median_gradient: 0.052\n        s020:\n          median_gradient: 0.148\n        s025:\n          median_gradient: 0.265\n        s030:\n          median_gradient: 0.715\n      qw_random:\n        s015:\n          median_gradient: 0.010\n        s020:\n          median_gradient: 0.042\n        s025:\n          median_gradient: 0.155\n        s030:\n          median_gradient: 0.480\n      strategy_specificity_ratio_ds:\n        s015: 1.3\n        s020: 1.3\n        s025: 1.2\n        s030: 1.2\n      strategy_specificity_ratio_qw:\n        s015: 1.2\n        s020: 1.1\n        s025: 1.2\n        s030: 1.1\n      strategy_specificity_ratio_range: \"1.1-1.3×\"\n      all_ratios_above_5x: false\n      gpqa_imp_rand_ratio_s030: 1.2\n      cross_benchmark_specificity_comparison:\n        math500: \"15-36×\"\n        gsm8k: \"2.3-3.8×\"\n        gpqa: \"1.1-1.3×\"\n      gradient_non_monotonic_random: false\n      note: >\n        Random gradient 在 GPQA 上与 importance 几乎相同（ratio ≈ 1.2），strategy specificity\n        在 GPQA 上完全消失。趋势：MATH 15-36× → GSM 2.3-3.8× → GPQA 1.1-1.3×，外推\n        意味着 \"更难/更短的任务上 strategy specificity 趋于 1\"。\n    result_rationale: >\n      GPQA 多选题格式下 reasoning chain 短（~300 tokens），importance score 在短 sequence\n      中的 discrimination 优势被大幅压缩。物理解释：\n      (1) Importance eviction 的优势依赖于 importance score 能准确识别 \"关键 token\" vs\n      \"冗余 token\"——在长 reasoning chain（MATH-500）中，late-phase token 累积了大量\n      attention pattern 的信息差异，importance score 的判别力强，random 无法匹配；\n      (2) 在短 chain（GPQA）中，attention pattern 尚未充分分化，importance score 的\n      判别力有限——pruning 后 discrimination collapse 使 importance eviction 接近 random，\n      两者 compound interaction 的 phase gradient 接近；\n      (3) Task-dependence 趋势（15-36× → 2.3-3.8× → 1.1-1.3×）完美对应 reasoning chain\n      length 的递减（MATH ~1200 → GSM ~400 → GPQA ~300 tokens），支持 \"strategy specificity\n      是 chain length 的函数\" 解读——这削弱了 strategy specificity 作为 fundamental finding\n      的叙事。\n      (4) GPQA random 也显示单调 gradient（与 importance 几乎平行），进一步支持 \"phase\n      gradient is universal, not strategy-specific\" 的 worst-tier narrative。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Strategy Specificity Ratio Across Benchmarks (Worst)\"\n        columns: [benchmark, ratio_range, interpretation]\n        rows:\n          - [MATH-500, \"15-36×\", \"very_high\"]\n          - [GSM8K, \"2.3-3.8×\", \"moderate\"]\n          - [GPQA, \"1.1-1.3×\", \"absent\"]\n      - name: \"Table: GPQA Importance vs Random Phase Gradient (DS)\"\n        columns: [sparsity, importance_gradient, random_gradient, ratio]\n        rows:\n          - [s015, 0.068, 0.052, 1.3]\n          - [s020, 0.195, 0.148, 1.3]\n          - [s025, 0.312, 0.265, 1.2]\n          - [s030, 0.855, 0.715, 1.2]\n    figures_description:\n      - >\n        fig_specificity_decay.pdf: Strategy specificity ratio vs benchmark 的柱状图。\n        三组柱（MATH/GSM/GPQA），从 15-36× 下降到 1.1-1.3×。标注 5× 阈值线（虚线），\n        GPQA 远低于阈值。附带 reasoning chain length annotation（平均 token count）。\n      - >\n        fig_gpqa_imp_vs_rand_worst.pdf: GPQA 上 importance vs random gradient 的双线图\n        （DS 和 QW 各一个 panel）。两条线几乎重合，阴影区域（差距）极窄。\n    analysis: >\n      GPQA strategy specificity ratio 1.1-1.3×，完全不具 practical significance。三\n      benchmark 构成 \"specificity decay\"：15-36× → 2.3-3.8× → 1.1-1.3×，与 reasoning\n      chain length 完美相关。Reviewer 将论证：(a) strategy specificity 不是 compound\n      compression 的固有属性，而是长 reasoning chain 的 artifact；(b) MATH-500 上的\n      15-36× 是 \"overfitting to a benchmark where importance happens to work well\"；\n      (c) 在实际部署场景中（混合 task），average specificity 接近 GSM8K/GPQA 水平\n      （2-3× 或更低），practical importance 有限。\n      Reframe 策略：承认 strategy specificity 是 task-modulated（chain length dependent），\n      将贡献重心转向 phase gradient 本身的 robustness 和 II 作为诊断工具的价值。\n\n  - name: \"Discrimination Collapse Quantitative Correlation Analysis\"\n    plan_id: \"mechanism_gini_correlation\"\n    description: >\n      利用 c5_per_phase_gini 和 c2_n500 数据计算 per-phase Gini_delta 与 II 的定量相关。\n      Worst 预测：within-model ρ=1.0 trivially，cross-model r < 0.7。\n    expected_results:\n      analysis_type: correlation of per-phase Gini collapse magnitude with II severity\n      data_source: c5_per_phase_gini (n=30 per model) + c2_n500 (n=500 per model)\n      ds_within_model:\n        gini_delta_low_phase: [-0.0163, -0.0209, -0.0313, -0.0373]\n        ii_median: [0.3907, 1.2149, 3.9857, 8.4813]\n        spearman_rho: 1.0\n        pearson_r: 0.93\n        pearson_p: 0.035\n      qw_within_model:\n        gini_delta_low_phase: [-0.0165, -0.0200, -0.0286, -0.0350]\n        ii_median: [0.0659, 0.3073, 1.0745, 3.1550]\n        spearman_rho: 1.0\n        pearson_r: 0.95\n        pearson_p: 0.025\n      cross_model_pooled:\n        n_datapoints: 8\n        spearman_rho: 0.55\n        pearson_r: 0.48\n        pearson_p: 0.115\n      cv_correlation:\n        ds_cv_delta_vs_ii_spearman: 1.0\n        qw_cv_delta_vs_ii_spearman: 1.0\n        cross_model_cv_pearson_r: 0.52\n      llama_validation:\n        note: >\n          LLaMA per-phase Gini 数据不可用（c8_llama_n250_fixed 不含 per-head Gini 计算），\n          无法加入 cross-model pooling。即使有，LLaMA 的 Gini-II 关系斜率会因 architecture\n          差异导致 cross-model r 进一步下降。\n    result_rationale: >\n      Within-model Spearman ρ=1.0 是 trivial 的——仅 4 个单调递增的点（sparsity s015-s030），\n      任何两个单调递增序列的 Spearman 都是 1.0。Pearson r=0.93/0.95 反映线性近似，但\n      仅 4 个点的 Pearson r 的统计功效极低（df=2, critical r at α=0.05 is 0.95）。\n      \n      Cross-model pooled 是关键指标，但 worst case 下 r=0.48：\n      (1) DS 和 QW 的 Gini_delta 范围相似（[-0.016, -0.037] vs [-0.017, -0.035]），\n      但 II 范围差异巨大（DS: 0.39-8.48 vs QW: 0.066-3.16）。这意味着 Gini→II 的\n      传递函数在两模型间斜率差 2-3 倍——pooled regression 被迫拟合两条不同斜率的线，\n      r 大幅下降。\n      (2) 8 个数据点中，DS 的 4 个点主导高 II 区间（II>1），QW 的 4 个点主导低 II\n      区间——两组点在 x-y 空间中形成两个分离的 cluster，pooled r 主要反映 cluster-level\n      的正趋势而非 within-cluster 的线性关系。\n      (3) Reviewer 会指出：cross-model r=0.48 不支持 \"Gini collapse quantitatively\n      predicts II severity\" 的声明——at best 它说明方向一致但量化关系是 model-specific。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Gini-II Correlation Summary (Worst)\"\n        columns: [scope, \"Spearman ρ\", \"Pearson r\", \"p-value\", interpretation]\n        rows:\n          - [\"DS within-model\", 1.0, 0.93, 0.035, \"trivially monotonic (n=4)\"]\n          - [\"QW within-model\", 1.0, 0.95, 0.025, \"trivially monotonic (n=4)\"]\n          - [\"Cross-model pooled\", 0.55, 0.48, 0.115, \"weak, NS\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - >\n        fig_gini_ii_scatter_worst.pdf: 散点图 |Gini_delta| vs II_median (log scale)。\n        DS 4 点（高 II 区间）和 QW 4 点（低 II 区间）形成两个分离 cluster。Pooled\n        回归线 r=0.48 但 CI band 极宽。两组分别画 within-model 回归线（斜率差异明显）。\n    analysis: >\n      Within-model ρ=1.0 是 trivial 的（4 个单调点），不应作为 \"quantitative prediction\"\n      claim。Cross-model r=0.48 不支持 \"Gini decline quantitatively predicts interaction\n      severity\" 的声明——两模型的 Gini-II 传递函数斜率不同，pooled 分析被 Simpson's\n      paradox-like 效应削弱。Reframe：Gini decline 方向跨模型一致（qualitative support\n      for discrimination collapse hypothesis），但 quantitative prediction 是 model-specific\n      的——论文降级为 \"Gini decline is a consistent correlate of II severity within each\n      model (ρ=1.0), but the Gini-to-II transfer function is architecture-dependent\"。\n      这仍支持 discrimination collapse 作为 mechanism hypothesis，但不支持 universal\n      quantitative law 的叙事。\n\n  - name: \"Language Switching at Intermediate Sparsities (s020/s025)\"\n    plan_id: \"c10_lang_s020_s025\"\n    description: >\n      填补 s020 和 s025 的 language switching rate 数据。注意：此实验已完成（DONE），\n      实际结果可用。Worst tier 关注 reviewer 的 dismissive 解读。\n    expected_results:\n      method: GPU inference + language detection\n      n_per_sparsity: 50\n      s020:\n        switch_rate: 0.14\n        cn_count: 7\n        en_count: 43\n        cn_acc: 0.333\n        en_acc: 0.25\n      s025:\n        switch_rate: 0.32\n        cn_count: 16\n        en_count: 34\n        cn_acc: 0.20\n        en_acc: 0.057\n      full_dose_response:\n        dense: 0.0\n        s015: 0.04\n        s020: 0.14\n        s025: 0.32\n        s030: 0.40\n      monotonic: true\n      spearman_rho: 1.0\n      note: >\n        实际数据已完成。Dose-response 单调递增。但 worst tier 下 reviewer 解读为\n        DeepSeek bilingual training artifact，非 compound sparsity 的 general 现象。\n    result_rationale: >\n      实验已完成，数据与 best tier 预测一致（单调递增）。但在 worst tier narrative 下，\n      reviewer 质疑：(1) Language switching 是 DeepSeek-R1-Distill 系列的特有 artifact\n      （bilingual 中英训练），Qwen 和 non-bilingual 模型上不会复现；(2) 这与 compound\n      sparsity 的 mechanism 无直接关系——任何足够 severe 的 perturbation 都可能触发\n      language switching，不证明 phase-dependent interaction 是原因；(3) 作为 behavioral\n      evidence 太间接，不能替代 direct mechanistic validation。Reviewer 建议移至 appendix\n      作为 interesting observation 但不支撑 core claims。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Language Switching Dose-Response (Actual Data)\"\n        columns: [sparsity, switch_rate, cn_count, cn_acc, en_acc, II_median]\n        rows:\n          - [dense, \"0%\", 0, \"n/a\", 0.74, 0]\n          - [s015, \"4%\", 2, 0.0, 0.48, 0.39]\n          - [s020, \"14%\", 7, 0.333, 0.25, 1.21]\n          - [s025, \"32%\", 16, 0.20, 0.057, 3.99]\n          - [s030, \"40%\", 20, 0.10, 0.10, 8.48]\n    figures_description:\n      - >\n        fig_lang_switching_actual.pdf: 实际数据与 II dose-response 的双 Y 轴图。\n        两条曲线同步上升。Reviewer 批注：\" DeepSeek-specific artifact\"。\n    analysis: >\n      数据本身 clean（单调递增，ρ=1.0），但在 worst tier 下其价值被限制。Reviewer\n      将其作为 \"interesting side observation\" 但不计入 contribution 评估。论文中最多\n      作为 §6 Discussion 的 behavioral illustration，不列入 core evidence。\n\n  - name: \"C9 Related Work Differentiation (Lethe/SparK/ThinKV/HIES/Physics-KV)\"\n    plan_id: \"c9_related_work\"\n    description: >\n      §2 Related Work 定位。Worst 预测：2+ reviewer 仍判 novelty insufficient，\n      Physics of KV Cache (2603.01426) 被认为已覆盖核心 narrative。\n    expected_results:\n      output_type: manuscript_section\n      reviewer_reception:\n        reviewer_1_novelty_concern: >\n          \"Physics of KV Cache Compression already characterizes phase-dependent\n          compression behavior with a rigorous theoretical framework. This paper's\n          empirical observation of phase-dependent compound interaction is a special\n          case of their general theory. The contribution is incremental.\"\n        reviewer_2_novelty_concern: >\n          \"HIES identified importance score collapse and proposed a fix. The\n          discrimination collapse mechanism here is essentially the same observation\n          applied to a compound setting. The 'compound amplification' claim is\n          interesting but the underlying mechanism is known.\"\n        reviewer_3_scope_concern: >\n          \"Results on 7B models only, strategy specificity doesn't hold on LLaMA\n          or GPQA. The core finding seems benchmark- and architecture-specific\n          rather than a general phenomenon.\"\n        novelty_challenged_count: 2\n        average_score: 2.7\n        accept_probability: 0.12\n      gap_analysis_effectiveness:\n        positioning_accepted: false\n        main_objection: >\n          Reviewers recognize the compound × phase × strategy 三维 framing as novel\n          in principle, but argue (a) the strategy dimension collapses on GPQA and LLaMA,\n          reducing it to compound × phase (already partially covered by Physics of KV);\n          (b) the phase dimension uses a different semantic of \"phase\" (reasoning phase\n          vs compression-rate phase transition), but the practical insight is similar —\n          \"compression hurts more at certain stages.\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      在 worst tier 下，即使 Related Work 写作清晰区分了本文与 prior work 的定位，\n      reviewer 仍因以下原因判 novelty insufficient：\n      (1) LLaMA 上 strategy specificity 消失（imp_vs_rand d_z < 0.20）→ \"strategy\"\n      维度不 robust，三维交互降级为二维（compound × phase）；\n      (2) GPQA 上 specificity ratio ≈ 1.1-1.3 → 在非 MATH-500 benchmark 上 \"strategy\"\n      维度也消失；\n      (3) 剩余的 \"compound × phase\" 二维交互被 Physics of KV Cache 的 phase transition\n      理论部分覆盖——虽然 \"phase\" 语义不同，但 reviewer 认为 insight level 相似；\n      (4) Discrimination collapse mechanism 被 HIES 的 score collapse 发现覆盖——\n      compound setting 中的放大效应被视为 \"straightforward extension\"；\n      (5) 7B 模型 + 有限 benchmark 的 scope 不足以支撑 EMNLP 发表。\n      Reframe 策略：从 finding paper 转向 methodology contribution——II 作为标准化\n      诊断指标 + per-problem paired bootstrap protocol + phase-stratified audit framework。\n      这避免了与 Physics of KV Cache 的 novelty 竞争。\n    tables: []\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: >\n      C9 在 worst tier 下 effectively fails——Related Work 的 gap analysis 虽然 technically\n      正确（没有 prior work 同时分析三维），但当 strategy 维度在 LLaMA 和 GPQA 上崩塌\n      时，novelty 的 unique contribution 缩水。2/3 reviewer 判 novelty insufficient，\n      average score 2.7，accept probability ~12%。\n      \n      Reframe 路径（仍冲 EMNLP，不降级目标）：\n      (1) Interaction Index (II) 作为 compound compression 的标准化诊断指标——prior work\n      缺乏统一量化框架。II 的 per-problem paired 定义 + bootstrap CI + phase stratification\n      是 methodological contribution。\n      (2) 证明 per-problem paired bootstrap + phase-stratified analysis 能揭示 aggregate\n      metrics（如 average perplexity）掩盖的 within-problem heterogeneity。\n      (3) Phase gradient 定位为 'robust phenomenon'（importance 内部始终 d_z>1.0 跨三架构），\n      strategy specificity 降级为 'one manifestation that varies by context'。\n      (4) Practical contribution：任何部署 compound compression 的团队都需 phase-stratified\n      audit，我们提供 protocol + open-source toolkit。\n      (5) Related Work 不再与 Physics of KV Cache 竞争 'phase' narrative，而定位为\n      complementary：他们做 single-axis phase transition 理论，我们做 compound-axis\n      phase-stratified empirical audit——维度正交。\n```"}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1319,"cache_read_input_tokens":100305,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1319},"output_tokens":8,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"57a0c9be-3448-41b8-a807-cd0aed32411d","uuid":"c91e8ade-19f4-4649-95ef-86ae2578e731"}
{"type":"result","subtype":"success","is_error":false,"api_error_status":null,"duration_ms":479730,"duration_api_ms":480647,"num_turns":11,"result":"Now I have the full picture. I have the best-tier dream report structure and all current registry data. Let me construct the worst-tier predictions.\n\n```yaml\ntier: worst\nnarrative_guidance: >\n  Strategy specificity 在新 benchmark/architecture 上消失。LLaMA n=250 确认 imp_vs_rand d_z\n  < 0.20（不是 n=50 功效不足——真效应就是 negligible），random phase gradient 在 LLaMA 上持续显著\n  （d_z 0.30+, CI 排除零），表明 phase gradient 是 universal phenomenon 而非 strategy-specific。\n  GPQA 上 importance gradient 可能仍单调但极弱，且 random 也展示类似 magnitude → imp/rand ratio\n  ≈ 1.0-1.5，无 strategy specificity。2+ reviewer 判 novelty insufficient：Physics of KV Cache\n  已刻画 phase-dependent compression behavior，HIES 已发现 score collapse，本文仅在 compound setting\n  中复现已知效应。核心 reframe：从 'finding paper' 转向 'methodology + diagnostic framework'——\n  提出 Interaction Index (II) 作为 compound compression 的标准化诊断指标，证明 per-problem paired\n  bootstrap + phase-stratified analysis 能揭示 aggregate metrics 掩盖的 heterogeneity。Phase gradient\n  定位为 'robust phenomenon'（importance 内部始终 d_z>1.0），strategy specificity 降级为\n  'one manifestation that varies by context, not the core contribution'。Related Work\n  不再与 Physics of KV Cache 竞争 'phase' narrative，而定位为 complementary。\n\nimagined_experiments:\n  - name: \"LLaMA n=250 Cross-Architecture Full Validation\"\n    plan_id: \"c8_llama_n250_fixed\"\n    description: >\n      在 DeepSeek-R1-Distill-Llama-8B 上扩展至 n=250，8 条件（importance/random × s015-s030）。\n      Worst 预测：imp_vs_rand d_z 全部 < 0.20，random phase gradient 持续显著。\n    expected_results:\n      model: DeepSeek-R1-Distill-Llama-8B\n      n_problems: 250\n      n_valid: 244\n      n_skipped: 6\n      conditions_completed: 8/8\n      n_bootstrap: 10000\n      bonferroni_k: 4\n      imp_vs_rand_dz:\n        s015: 0.10\n        s020: 0.12\n        s025: 0.15\n        s030: 0.18\n      imp_vs_rand_dz_ci:\n        s015: [-0.03, 0.23]\n        s020: [-0.01, 0.25]\n        s025: [0.02, 0.28]\n        s030: [0.05, 0.31]\n      imp_vs_rand_dz_interpretation:\n        s015: negligible\n        s020: negligible\n        s025: negligible\n        s030: negligible\n      imp_vs_rand_dz_monotonic: true\n      phase_gradient_importance_dz:\n        s015: 0.95\n        s020: 1.05\n        s025: 1.08\n        s030: 0.98\n      phase_gradient_importance_dz_ci:\n        s015: [0.75, 1.15]\n        s020: [0.87, 1.23]\n        s025: [0.90, 1.26]\n        s030: [0.82, 1.14]\n      phase_gradient_importance_interpretation: all_large\n      phase_gradient_random_dz:\n        s015: 0.30\n        s020: 0.33\n        s025: 0.38\n        s030: 0.36\n      phase_gradient_random_dz_ci:\n        s015: [0.13, 0.47]\n        s020: [0.16, 0.50]\n        s025: [0.21, 0.55]\n        s030: [0.19, 0.53]\n      phase_gradient_random_interpretation: all_small_but_significant\n      median_diff:\n        s015: 0.012\n        s020: 0.018\n        s025: 0.055\n        s030: 0.145\n      median_diff_ci:\n        s015: [-0.005, 0.032]\n        s020: [-0.028, 0.070]\n        s025: [-0.020, 0.155]\n        s030: [-0.035, 0.310]\n      wilcoxon_p:\n        s015: 0.135\n        s020: 0.098\n        s025: 0.052\n        s030: 0.028\n      wilcoxon_p_bonferroni:\n        s015: 0.540\n        s020: 0.392\n        s025: 0.208\n        s030: 0.112\n      significant_bonferroni:\n        s015: false\n        s020: false\n        s025: false\n        s030: false\n      bonferroni_significant_count: 0\n      cross_arch_comparison:\n        deepseek_qwen2_imp_vs_rand_dz_s030: 0.80\n        llama_imp_vs_rand_dz_s030: 0.18\n        delta: 0.62\n        note: >\n          LLaMA imp_vs_rand d_z=0.18 远低于 Qwen2 架构的 0.80。Strategy × phase interaction\n          在 LLaMA 上 effectively absent——importance 和 random 均展示 phase gradient，差异\n          不足以达到统计显著。Strategy specificity 是 architecture-dependent 而非 universal。\n    result_rationale: >\n      n=50 时 imp_vs_rand d_z=0.19→0.34 反映了小样本噪声膨胀——CI 极宽（s030: [0.06,0.66]），\n      真值可能在区间下端。n=250 将 SE 缩小 √5≈2.24 倍，效应量估计趋于真值。关键推理：\n      (1) LLaMA 架构（standard MHA, 32 heads/layer）的 attention head 冗余结构不同于 Qwen2\n      的 GQA——pruning 后 importance score 的 phase-dependent 行为在两种架构上定性不同。LLaMA\n      的均匀 head 分布使得 pruning 对 importance score discrimination 的影响在各 phase 间更对称，\n      importance 和 random 的差异缩小。\n      (2) n=50 时 random phase gradient d_z=0.35-0.44 不是 Type I error——LLaMA 的 attention\n      redistribution 模式确实使 random masking 也产生 phase-dependent compound effect。n=250\n      确认 random d_z 稳定在 0.30-0.38（CI 排除零），这与 DS/QW 在低 sparsity 下 random NS\n      的模式定性不同，是 LLaMA 架构的 genuine 特征。\n      (3) 结果是 imp_vs_rand d_z 收缩至 0.10-0.18，全部低于 medium effect 阈值，0 个\n      Bonferroni 显著。Phase gradient 在 importance 内强烈（d_z≈1.0），但这是 universal 的\n      phase effect，不是 strategy-specific interaction——random 也显示 d_z 0.30-0.38 的\n      non-trivial gradient。核心 C1 framing \"'severity is strategy×phase emergent'\" 在\n      LLaMA 上不成立，须降级为 \"'phase gradient is universal, strategy modulation is\n      architecture-dependent'\"。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: LLaMA n=250 vs n=50 Effect Size Comparison\"\n        columns: [sparsity, n50_dz, n250_dz, n250_bonf_p, n250_significant]\n        rows:\n          - [s015, 0.19, 0.10, 0.540, \"NS\"]\n          - [s020, 0.26, 0.12, 0.392, \"NS\"]\n          - [s025, 0.29, 0.15, 0.208, \"NS\"]\n          - [s030, 0.34, 0.18, 0.112, \"NS\"]\n      - name: \"Table: Random Phase Gradient Persistence (n=50 → n=250)\"\n        columns: [sparsity, n50_random_dz, n250_random_dz, n250_random_CI_excludes_zero]\n        rows:\n          - [s015, 0.35, 0.30, \"yes\"]\n          - [s020, 0.37, 0.33, \"yes\"]\n          - [s025, 0.45, 0.38, \"yes\"]\n          - [s030, 0.44, 0.36, \"yes\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - >\n        fig_c8_n250_worst.pdf: 左 panel=imp_vs_rand d_z 随 sparsity 变化（n=50 虚线 vs\n        n=250 实线，含 CI band），所有 n=250 点 CI 含零或 borderline。右 panel=importance\n        vs random phase gradient d_z 在 n=250 下的对比——两者 CI 大量重叠，importance\n        略高但差异不显著。灰色虚线标注 medium effect 阈值 d_z=0.4。\n    analysis: >\n      LLaMA n=250 确认 strategy×phase interaction 在 LLaMA 架构上 effectively absent。\n      n=50 的 d_z=0.34 (s030) 是小样本噪声膨胀，真值 d_z=0.18（negligible）。更关键的是，\n      random phase gradient 在 n=250 下仍显著（d_z 0.30-0.38），且 CI 排除零——这与\n      DeepSeek/Qwen 上 random 低 sparsity NS 的模式定性不同。解读：phase gradient 是\n      universal phenomenon（importance 和 random 均展示），strategy specificity 是\n      architecture-dependent 的——仅在 Qwen2 架构上稳健，LLaMA 上不成立。\n      论文必须将 C8 从 \"partially_confirmed\" 改为 \"architecture-dependent\"，Abstract/Intro\n      不能声明 \"strategy×phase interaction generalizes across architectures\"。\n      Framing 修改：phase gradient 作为 robust universal finding（三架构均 d_z>0.9 for\n      importance），strategy specificity 作为 Qwen2-specific observation that requires\n      further investigation across architectures。\n\n  - name: \"GPQA DeepSeek Importance Phase Gradient Profiling\"\n    plan_id: \"gpqa_profiling_ds\"\n    description: >\n      在 DeepSeek-R1-Distill-Qwen-7B 上对 GPQA-Diamond (n≤198) 运行 importance masking\n      across 4 sparsity levels。Worst 预测：gradient 非单调或极弱。\n    expected_results:\n      model: DeepSeek-R1-Distill-Qwen-7B\n      benchmark: GPQA-Diamond\n      n_problems: 198\n      mid_null_rate: 0.42\n      effective_n: 115\n      method: median + Wilcoxon + bootstrap_median(B=10000)\n      importance:\n        s015:\n          median_gradient: 0.068\n          ci_low: -0.015\n          ci_high: 0.182\n          wilcoxon_p: 0.085\n        s020:\n          median_gradient: 0.195\n          ci_low: 0.042\n          ci_high: 0.405\n          wilcoxon_p: 0.012\n        s025:\n          median_gradient: 0.312\n          ci_low: 0.085\n          ci_high: 0.622\n          wilcoxon_p: 0.005\n        s030:\n          median_gradient: 0.855\n          ci_low: 0.285\n          ci_high: 1.680\n          wilcoxon_p: 0.001\n      dose_response_monotonic: true\n      spearman_rho: 1.0\n      cross_benchmark_comparison:\n        math500_ds_gradient_s030: 8.48\n        gsm8k_ds_gradient_s030: 4.682\n        gpqa_ds_gradient_s030: 0.855\n        ratio_math_to_gpqa: 9.9\n        note: >\n          GPQA gradient magnitude 仅为 MATH-500 的 ~10%，远低于 GSM8K。GPQA 多选题格式\n          导致 reasoning chain 短（平均 ~300 tokens vs MATH-500 ~1200 tokens），low-sparsity\n          phase token 极少，phase gradient 被压缩。\n    result_rationale: >\n      GPQA-Diamond 是 graduate-level 多选题，格式决定了 reasoning chain 远短于 MATH-500。\n      DeepSeek-R1-Distill-Qwen-7B 对 GPQA 的生成通常 300-600 tokens（vs MATH-500 的\n      800-2000 tokens），且 <think> 段落较短（多选题不需要长推理链）。这导致：\n      (1) Phase segmentation 后 low-sparsity phase 包含的 token 很少，mid phase 高 null rate\n      （~42%），compound interaction 的 phase-dependent 放大效应被稀释；\n      (2) Gradient magnitude 仅 0.068→0.855——虽然单调但 s030 仅 0.855，不到 MATH-500\n      的 1/10。物理原因：短 reasoning chain 意味着 head pruning 对 importance score\n      discrimination 的影响没有足够的 token 累积来放大 compound effect；\n      (3) s015 的 CI 跨零（p=0.085），Bonferroni 后更不显著——GPQA 在低 sparsity 下\n      compound effect 不可检测。Dose-response 虽然技术上单调（ρ=1.0），但 absolute\n      magnitude 太小，reviewer 会质疑 practical significance。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Cross-Benchmark Phase Gradient Comparison (DeepSeek)\"\n        columns: [sparsity, MATH-500, GSM8K, GPQA]\n        rows:\n          - [s015, 0.39, 0.241, 0.068]\n          - [s020, 1.21, 0.740, 0.195]\n          - [s025, 3.99, 1.992, 0.312]\n          - [s030, 8.48, 4.682, 0.855]\n    figures_description:\n      - >\n        fig_cross_benchmark_gradient_worst.pdf: 三条线(MATH/GSM/GPQA)展示 DS importance\n        phase gradient。GPQA 曲线几乎贴近 x 轴，与 MATH-500 差距巨大。Y 轴 log scale\n        使三条线可见但 GPQA gradient 在 linear scale 上 visually trivial。\n    analysis: >\n      GPQA gradient 技术上单调但 magnitude 极弱（s030 仅 0.855 vs MATH-500 的 8.48），\n      构成 \"effect disappears on different tasks\" 的叙事风险。Reviewer 会解读为：\n      phase gradient 的 magnitude 是 task-dependent 的，MATH-500 上的强效应可能是\n      overfitting to one specific benchmark 的 reasoning chain 结构。加上 GSM8K 已显示\n      衰减（4.68），GPQA 进一步衰减至 <1，趋势指向 \"effect diminishes as task changes\"。\n      Reframe：phase gradient 方向一致但 magnitude task-dependent，强调方向 robustness\n      而非 magnitude，将 magnitude variation 归因于 reasoning chain length differences\n      （可量化：MATH ~1200 tok, GSM ~400 tok, GPQA ~300 tok）。\n\n  - name: \"GPQA Qwen Importance Phase Gradient Profiling\"\n    plan_id: \"gpqa_profiling_qw\"\n    description: >\n      在 Qwen2.5-7B-Instruct 上对 GPQA-Diamond 运行 importance masking，验证 cross-model。\n      Worst 预测：QW 效应更弱，s015/s020 NS。\n    expected_results:\n      model: Qwen2.5-7B-Instruct\n      benchmark: GPQA-Diamond\n      n_problems: 198\n      mid_null_rate: 0.55\n      effective_n: 89\n      importance:\n        s015:\n          median_gradient: 0.012\n          ci_low: -0.025\n          ci_high: 0.058\n          wilcoxon_p: 0.32\n        s020:\n          median_gradient: 0.048\n          ci_low: -0.008\n          ci_high: 0.125\n          wilcoxon_p: 0.078\n        s025:\n          median_gradient: 0.185\n          ci_low: 0.035\n          ci_high: 0.405\n          wilcoxon_p: 0.008\n        s030:\n          median_gradient: 0.520\n          ci_low: 0.145\n          ci_high: 1.050\n          wilcoxon_p: 0.002\n      dose_response_monotonic: true\n      spearman_rho: 1.0\n      qw_ds_gradient_ratio_s030: 0.61\n      note: >\n        QW gradient ~61% of DS（与 MATH-500 pattern 一致），但 absolute magnitude\n        极小——s030 仅 0.52，s015/s020 CI 含零。\n    result_rationale: >\n      QW 在 MATH-500 上 gradient 为 DS 的 ~37%（3.155 vs 8.48），在 GSM8K 上约 45%\n      （2.092 vs 4.682）。GPQA 上预测 QW ~61% of DS。QW 的 attention head utilization\n      更均匀，pruning 影响更分散，compound interaction 更弱。GPQA 短 reasoning chain\n      进一步压缩效应。s015 和 s020 的 gradient 极小（0.012 和 0.048），CI 含零，不可靠。\n      高 mid_null_rate（55%）反映 QW 在 GPQA 上的 reasoning chain 更短更不稳定——many\n      problems 的 mid phase 基本为空。仅 s025/s030 Wilcoxon 显著，但 Bonferroni k=4\n      后 s025 borderline。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Cross-Benchmark Phase Gradient Comparison (Qwen)\"\n        columns: [sparsity, MATH-500, GSM8K, GPQA]\n        rows:\n          - [s015, 0.066, 0.039, 0.012]\n          - [s020, 0.307, 0.158, 0.048]\n          - [s025, 1.075, 1.100, 0.185]\n          - [s030, 3.155, 2.092, 0.520]\n    figures_description:\n      - >\n        fig_qw_cross_benchmark_worst.pdf: QW 三 benchmark gradient 曲线。GPQA 几乎平坦，\n        与 MATH-500/GSM8K 差距明显。\n    analysis: >\n      QW GPQA gradient s030=0.52，不到 MATH-500 的 1/6。Cross-model replication 方向一致\n      但 magnitude 进一步衰减。两模型 × 三 benchmark 的 gradient magnitude 矩阵显示\n      明确的 task-dependence：MATH-500 >> GSM8K >> GPQA。Reviewer 会用此论证 \"phase\n      gradient magnitude is primarily driven by reasoning chain length, not a fundamental\n      property of compound compression\"——如果效应量完全由 chain length 解释，则贡献\n      降级为 trivial observation。\n\n  - name: \"GPQA Random Baselines and Strategy Specificity Ratio\"\n    plan_id: \"gpqa_random_baselines\"\n    description: >\n      在 GPQA-Diamond 上对 DS 和 QW 运行 random masking，计算 strategy specificity ratio。\n      Worst 预测：ratio ≈ 1.0-1.5，无 strategy specificity。\n    expected_results:\n      ds_random:\n        s015:\n          median_gradient: 0.052\n        s020:\n          median_gradient: 0.148\n        s025:\n          median_gradient: 0.265\n        s030:\n          median_gradient: 0.715\n      qw_random:\n        s015:\n          median_gradient: 0.010\n        s020:\n          median_gradient: 0.042\n        s025:\n          median_gradient: 0.155\n        s030:\n          median_gradient: 0.480\n      strategy_specificity_ratio_ds:\n        s015: 1.3\n        s020: 1.3\n        s025: 1.2\n        s030: 1.2\n      strategy_specificity_ratio_qw:\n        s015: 1.2\n        s020: 1.1\n        s025: 1.2\n        s030: 1.1\n      strategy_specificity_ratio_range: \"1.1-1.3×\"\n      all_ratios_above_5x: false\n      gpqa_imp_rand_ratio_s030: 1.2\n      cross_benchmark_specificity_comparison:\n        math500: \"15-36×\"\n        gsm8k: \"2.3-3.8×\"\n        gpqa: \"1.1-1.3×\"\n      gradient_non_monotonic_random: false\n      note: >\n        Random gradient 在 GPQA 上与 importance 几乎相同（ratio ≈ 1.2），strategy specificity\n        在 GPQA 上完全消失。趋势：MATH 15-36× → GSM 2.3-3.8× → GPQA 1.1-1.3×，外推\n        意味着 \"更难/更短的任务上 strategy specificity 趋于 1\"。\n    result_rationale: >\n      GPQA 多选题格式下 reasoning chain 短（~300 tokens），importance score 在短 sequence\n      中的 discrimination 优势被大幅压缩。物理解释：\n      (1) Importance eviction 的优势依赖于 importance score 能准确识别 \"关键 token\" vs\n      \"冗余 token\"——在长 reasoning chain（MATH-500）中，late-phase token 累积了大量\n      attention pattern 的信息差异，importance score 的判别力强，random 无法匹配；\n      (2) 在短 chain（GPQA）中，attention pattern 尚未充分分化，importance score 的\n      判别力有限——pruning 后 discrimination collapse 使 importance eviction 接近 random，\n      两者 compound interaction 的 phase gradient 接近；\n      (3) Task-dependence 趋势（15-36× → 2.3-3.8× → 1.1-1.3×）完美对应 reasoning chain\n      length 的递减（MATH ~1200 → GSM ~400 → GPQA ~300 tokens），支持 \"strategy specificity\n      是 chain length 的函数\" 解读——这削弱了 strategy specificity 作为 fundamental finding\n      的叙事。\n      (4) GPQA random 也显示单调 gradient（与 importance 几乎平行），进一步支持 \"phase\n      gradient is universal, not strategy-specific\" 的 worst-tier narrative。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Strategy Specificity Ratio Across Benchmarks (Worst)\"\n        columns: [benchmark, ratio_range, interpretation]\n        rows:\n          - [MATH-500, \"15-36×\", \"very_high\"]\n          - [GSM8K, \"2.3-3.8×\", \"moderate\"]\n          - [GPQA, \"1.1-1.3×\", \"absent\"]\n      - name: \"Table: GPQA Importance vs Random Phase Gradient (DS)\"\n        columns: [sparsity, importance_gradient, random_gradient, ratio]\n        rows:\n          - [s015, 0.068, 0.052, 1.3]\n          - [s020, 0.195, 0.148, 1.3]\n          - [s025, 0.312, 0.265, 1.2]\n          - [s030, 0.855, 0.715, 1.2]\n    figures_description:\n      - >\n        fig_specificity_decay.pdf: Strategy specificity ratio vs benchmark 的柱状图。\n        三组柱（MATH/GSM/GPQA），从 15-36× 下降到 1.1-1.3×。标注 5× 阈值线（虚线），\n        GPQA 远低于阈值。附带 reasoning chain length annotation（平均 token count）。\n      - >\n        fig_gpqa_imp_vs_rand_worst.pdf: GPQA 上 importance vs random gradient 的双线图\n        （DS 和 QW 各一个 panel）。两条线几乎重合，阴影区域（差距）极窄。\n    analysis: >\n      GPQA strategy specificity ratio 1.1-1.3×，完全不具 practical significance。三\n      benchmark 构成 \"specificity decay\"：15-36× → 2.3-3.8× → 1.1-1.3×，与 reasoning\n      chain length 完美相关。Reviewer 将论证：(a) strategy specificity 不是 compound\n      compression 的固有属性，而是长 reasoning chain 的 artifact；(b) MATH-500 上的\n      15-36× 是 \"overfitting to a benchmark where importance happens to work well\"；\n      (c) 在实际部署场景中（混合 task），average specificity 接近 GSM8K/GPQA 水平\n      （2-3× 或更低），practical importance 有限。\n      Reframe 策略：承认 strategy specificity 是 task-modulated（chain length dependent），\n      将贡献重心转向 phase gradient 本身的 robustness 和 II 作为诊断工具的价值。\n\n  - name: \"Discrimination Collapse Quantitative Correlation Analysis\"\n    plan_id: \"mechanism_gini_correlation\"\n    description: >\n      利用 c5_per_phase_gini 和 c2_n500 数据计算 per-phase Gini_delta 与 II 的定量相关。\n      Worst 预测：within-model ρ=1.0 trivially，cross-model r < 0.7。\n    expected_results:\n      analysis_type: correlation of per-phase Gini collapse magnitude with II severity\n      data_source: c5_per_phase_gini (n=30 per model) + c2_n500 (n=500 per model)\n      ds_within_model:\n        gini_delta_low_phase: [-0.0163, -0.0209, -0.0313, -0.0373]\n        ii_median: [0.3907, 1.2149, 3.9857, 8.4813]\n        spearman_rho: 1.0\n        pearson_r: 0.93\n        pearson_p: 0.035\n      qw_within_model:\n        gini_delta_low_phase: [-0.0165, -0.0200, -0.0286, -0.0350]\n        ii_median: [0.0659, 0.3073, 1.0745, 3.1550]\n        spearman_rho: 1.0\n        pearson_r: 0.95\n        pearson_p: 0.025\n      cross_model_pooled:\n        n_datapoints: 8\n        spearman_rho: 0.55\n        pearson_r: 0.48\n        pearson_p: 0.115\n      cv_correlation:\n        ds_cv_delta_vs_ii_spearman: 1.0\n        qw_cv_delta_vs_ii_spearman: 1.0\n        cross_model_cv_pearson_r: 0.52\n      llama_validation:\n        note: >\n          LLaMA per-phase Gini 数据不可用（c8_llama_n250_fixed 不含 per-head Gini 计算），\n          无法加入 cross-model pooling。即使有，LLaMA 的 Gini-II 关系斜率会因 architecture\n          差异导致 cross-model r 进一步下降。\n    result_rationale: >\n      Within-model Spearman ρ=1.0 是 trivial 的——仅 4 个单调递增的点（sparsity s015-s030），\n      任何两个单调递增序列的 Spearman 都是 1.0。Pearson r=0.93/0.95 反映线性近似，但\n      仅 4 个点的 Pearson r 的统计功效极低（df=2, critical r at α=0.05 is 0.95）。\n      \n      Cross-model pooled 是关键指标，但 worst case 下 r=0.48：\n      (1) DS 和 QW 的 Gini_delta 范围相似（[-0.016, -0.037] vs [-0.017, -0.035]），\n      但 II 范围差异巨大（DS: 0.39-8.48 vs QW: 0.066-3.16）。这意味着 Gini→II 的\n      传递函数在两模型间斜率差 2-3 倍——pooled regression 被迫拟合两条不同斜率的线，\n      r 大幅下降。\n      (2) 8 个数据点中，DS 的 4 个点主导高 II 区间（II>1），QW 的 4 个点主导低 II\n      区间——两组点在 x-y 空间中形成两个分离的 cluster，pooled r 主要反映 cluster-level\n      的正趋势而非 within-cluster 的线性关系。\n      (3) Reviewer 会指出：cross-model r=0.48 不支持 \"Gini collapse quantitatively\n      predicts II severity\" 的声明——at best 它说明方向一致但量化关系是 model-specific。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Gini-II Correlation Summary (Worst)\"\n        columns: [scope, \"Spearman ρ\", \"Pearson r\", \"p-value\", interpretation]\n        rows:\n          - [\"DS within-model\", 1.0, 0.93, 0.035, \"trivially monotonic (n=4)\"]\n          - [\"QW within-model\", 1.0, 0.95, 0.025, \"trivially monotonic (n=4)\"]\n          - [\"Cross-model pooled\", 0.55, 0.48, 0.115, \"weak, NS\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - >\n        fig_gini_ii_scatter_worst.pdf: 散点图 |Gini_delta| vs II_median (log scale)。\n        DS 4 点（高 II 区间）和 QW 4 点（低 II 区间）形成两个分离 cluster。Pooled\n        回归线 r=0.48 但 CI band 极宽。两组分别画 within-model 回归线（斜率差异明显）。\n    analysis: >\n      Within-model ρ=1.0 是 trivial 的（4 个单调点），不应作为 \"quantitative prediction\"\n      claim。Cross-model r=0.48 不支持 \"Gini decline quantitatively predicts interaction\n      severity\" 的声明——两模型的 Gini-II 传递函数斜率不同，pooled 分析被 Simpson's\n      paradox-like 效应削弱。Reframe：Gini decline 方向跨模型一致（qualitative support\n      for discrimination collapse hypothesis），但 quantitative prediction 是 model-specific\n      的——论文降级为 \"Gini decline is a consistent correlate of II severity within each\n      model (ρ=1.0), but the Gini-to-II transfer function is architecture-dependent\"。\n      这仍支持 discrimination collapse 作为 mechanism hypothesis，但不支持 universal\n      quantitative law 的叙事。\n\n  - name: \"Language Switching at Intermediate Sparsities (s020/s025)\"\n    plan_id: \"c10_lang_s020_s025\"\n    description: >\n      填补 s020 和 s025 的 language switching rate 数据。注意：此实验已完成（DONE），\n      实际结果可用。Worst tier 关注 reviewer 的 dismissive 解读。\n    expected_results:\n      method: GPU inference + language detection\n      n_per_sparsity: 50\n      s020:\n        switch_rate: 0.14\n        cn_count: 7\n        en_count: 43\n        cn_acc: 0.333\n        en_acc: 0.25\n      s025:\n        switch_rate: 0.32\n        cn_count: 16\n        en_count: 34\n        cn_acc: 0.20\n        en_acc: 0.057\n      full_dose_response:\n        dense: 0.0\n        s015: 0.04\n        s020: 0.14\n        s025: 0.32\n        s030: 0.40\n      monotonic: true\n      spearman_rho: 1.0\n      note: >\n        实际数据已完成。Dose-response 单调递增。但 worst tier 下 reviewer 解读为\n        DeepSeek bilingual training artifact，非 compound sparsity 的 general 现象。\n    result_rationale: >\n      实验已完成，数据与 best tier 预测一致（单调递增）。但在 worst tier narrative 下，\n      reviewer 质疑：(1) Language switching 是 DeepSeek-R1-Distill 系列的特有 artifact\n      （bilingual 中英训练），Qwen 和 non-bilingual 模型上不会复现；(2) 这与 compound\n      sparsity 的 mechanism 无直接关系——任何足够 severe 的 perturbation 都可能触发\n      language switching，不证明 phase-dependent interaction 是原因；(3) 作为 behavioral\n      evidence 太间接，不能替代 direct mechanistic validation。Reviewer 建议移至 appendix\n      作为 interesting observation 但不支撑 core claims。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Language Switching Dose-Response (Actual Data)\"\n        columns: [sparsity, switch_rate, cn_count, cn_acc, en_acc, II_median]\n        rows:\n          - [dense, \"0%\", 0, \"n/a\", 0.74, 0]\n          - [s015, \"4%\", 2, 0.0, 0.48, 0.39]\n          - [s020, \"14%\", 7, 0.333, 0.25, 1.21]\n          - [s025, \"32%\", 16, 0.20, 0.057, 3.99]\n          - [s030, \"40%\", 20, 0.10, 0.10, 8.48]\n    figures_description:\n      - >\n        fig_lang_switching_actual.pdf: 实际数据与 II dose-response 的双 Y 轴图。\n        两条曲线同步上升。Reviewer 批注：\" DeepSeek-specific artifact\"。\n    analysis: >\n      数据本身 clean（单调递增，ρ=1.0），但在 worst tier 下其价值被限制。Reviewer\n      将其作为 \"interesting side observation\" 但不计入 contribution 评估。论文中最多\n      作为 §6 Discussion 的 behavioral illustration，不列入 core evidence。\n\n  - name: \"C9 Related Work Differentiation (Lethe/SparK/ThinKV/HIES/Physics-KV)\"\n    plan_id: \"c9_related_work\"\n    description: >\n      §2 Related Work 定位。Worst 预测：2+ reviewer 仍判 novelty insufficient，\n      Physics of KV Cache (2603.01426) 被认为已覆盖核心 narrative。\n    expected_results:\n      output_type: manuscript_section\n      reviewer_reception:\n        reviewer_1_novelty_concern: >\n          \"Physics of KV Cache Compression already characterizes phase-dependent\n          compression behavior with a rigorous theoretical framework. This paper's\n          empirical observation of phase-dependent compound interaction is a special\n          case of their general theory. The contribution is incremental.\"\n        reviewer_2_novelty_concern: >\n          \"HIES identified importance score collapse and proposed a fix. The\n          discrimination collapse mechanism here is essentially the same observation\n          applied to a compound setting. The 'compound amplification' claim is\n          interesting but the underlying mechanism is known.\"\n        reviewer_3_scope_concern: >\n          \"Results on 7B models only, strategy specificity doesn't hold on LLaMA\n          or GPQA. The core finding seems benchmark- and architecture-specific\n          rather than a general phenomenon.\"\n        novelty_challenged_count: 2\n        average_score: 2.7\n        accept_probability: 0.12\n      gap_analysis_effectiveness:\n        positioning_accepted: false\n        main_objection: >\n          Reviewers recognize the compound × phase × strategy 三维 framing as novel\n          in principle, but argue (a) the strategy dimension collapses on GPQA and LLaMA,\n          reducing it to compound × phase (already partially covered by Physics of KV);\n          (b) the phase dimension uses a different semantic of \"phase\" (reasoning phase\n          vs compression-rate phase transition), but the practical insight is similar —\n          \"compression hurts more at certain stages.\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      在 worst tier 下，即使 Related Work 写作清晰区分了本文与 prior work 的定位，\n      reviewer 仍因以下原因判 novelty insufficient：\n      (1) LLaMA 上 strategy specificity 消失（imp_vs_rand d_z < 0.20）→ \"strategy\"\n      维度不 robust，三维交互降级为二维（compound × phase）；\n      (2) GPQA 上 specificity ratio ≈ 1.1-1.3 → 在非 MATH-500 benchmark 上 \"strategy\"\n      维度也消失；\n      (3) 剩余的 \"compound × phase\" 二维交互被 Physics of KV Cache 的 phase transition\n      理论部分覆盖——虽然 \"phase\" 语义不同，但 reviewer 认为 insight level 相似；\n      (4) Discrimination collapse mechanism 被 HIES 的 score collapse 发现覆盖——\n      compound setting 中的放大效应被视为 \"straightforward extension\"；\n      (5) 7B 模型 + 有限 benchmark 的 scope 不足以支撑 EMNLP 发表。\n      Reframe 策略：从 finding paper 转向 methodology contribution——II 作为标准化\n      诊断指标 + per-problem paired bootstrap protocol + phase-stratified audit framework。\n      这避免了与 Physics of KV Cache 的 novelty 竞争。\n    tables: []\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: >\n      C9 在 worst tier 下 effectively fails——Related Work 的 gap analysis 虽然 technically\n      正确（没有 prior work 同时分析三维），但当 strategy 维度在 LLaMA 和 GPQA 上崩塌\n      时，novelty 的 unique contribution 缩水。2/3 reviewer 判 novelty insufficient，\n      average score 2.7，accept probability ~12%。\n      \n      Reframe 路径（仍冲 EMNLP，不降级目标）：\n      (1) Interaction Index (II) 作为 compound compression 的标准化诊断指标——prior work\n      缺乏统一量化框架。II 的 per-problem paired 定义 + bootstrap CI + phase stratification\n      是 methodological contribution。\n      (2) 证明 per-problem paired bootstrap + phase-stratified analysis 能揭示 aggregate\n      metrics（如 average perplexity）掩盖的 within-problem heterogeneity。\n      (3) Phase gradient 定位为 'robust phenomenon'（importance 内部始终 d_z>1.0 跨三架构），\n      strategy specificity 降级为 'one manifestation that varies by context'。\n      (4) Practical contribution：任何部署 compound compression 的团队都需 phase-stratified\n      audit，我们提供 protocol + open-source toolkit。\n      (5) Related Work 不再与 Physics of KV Cache 竞争 'phase' narrative，而定位为\n      complementary：他们做 single-axis phase transition 理论，我们做 compound-axis\n      phase-stratified empirical audit——维度正交。\n```","stop_reason":"end_turn","session_id":"57a0c9be-3448-41b8-a807-cd0aed32411d","total_cost_usd":1.33995825,"usage":{"input_tokens":12,"cache_creation_input_tokens":33085,"cache_read_input_tokens":911082,"output_tokens":19058,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":33085,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[{"input_tokens":1,"output_tokens":14717,"cache_read_input_tokens":100305,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1319,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1319},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"modelUsage":{"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001":{"inputTokens":51712,"outputTokens":4282,"cacheReadInputTokens":340915,"cach